<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">John ne Raukegai Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jhn.</para>
  <para style="mt">John</para>
  <para style="mt">John Samliakeyi</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Samliakeyi mdaibe debai Jisu ne ledeukelu kereiekena hangge John ne raugai, “Jisu hung kela ledeukelube.” John Samliakeyi aide AD 90-100 kakga raugai iciu eh “nnui Jisu au Khrista, Tinggwang Na lie eh nlumlu kerane nah nnui nlumlu eh pezi gade kering ngaulu kerane” (John 20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">John laisiukwak aide Jisu Khrista teilung nah pe bata hadung ge raugai liede, cide au Samliakeyi keda kecumdung dade tsamceu. John au Samliakeyi kedadung ga raupwala kemak ha raugai. Miswakega bata Samliakeyi kedadung ga raupwa kela kena rünne John ga la. Laisiukwak aika samgwa kegai gede bam ma nah Jisu mina nlimedung kempau ha rangmting gai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Samliakeyi aide ta cai zasidung, Samliakeyidung ga miswakega batadung lie kebamdung de, ranglia gaibam. John raukegai zasi aidungde Khrista au Tinggwang lie kecu nah kengkieng kedi bamlie kecu kesang delie raugai. John au Jisu de Tinggwang Nabe lie kecu rangmci kegai rünne mene Jisu au leu, pe suisia, mzeu, nah mide keku gade, mina kesang lie kecu liagai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Samkeraibe nah samdi (1:1-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu ha rangliakegai (1:19-4:54)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang Na tei eh Jisu bata keteidung (5:1-10:42)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem ga kebwakkedi (11:1-12:50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu ledeukelume de ngngwakela (13:1-17:26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kedei, ketsai, nah kekung (18:1-19:42)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ringcuh kecu nah sam kekambe (20:1-21:25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Sambe mina mmi di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Kendeu gade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kendeu gade: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sambe au kideu damgai kemak dwa de ladi da.</char></note> Sambe la, nah Sambe Tinggwang de ngngwa la, nah Sambe au Tinggwang da. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Pa au kendeu gade Tinggwang de ngngwa la. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Maleune de pe dade teilu, nah teikelube pecu si mene teikelu kette gah. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Keringria peda la, nah keringria au mina kebaabe. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Kebaabe kemui ga baa la, nah kemuibe peswa ngkienglu tadi. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Tinggwang ne langkegai mige bam, pezi au John. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Pa kebaabe ha ranglia kerane zierang tei eh gwang, ciu eh peciakne pe dade nlumlu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />John au kebaabe ma, dede kebaabe ha zierang tei kerane pa gwang. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Kebaa kesangbe, mina pelane de kebaa peu kelabe, kideu ga gwangla dida. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Pa au kideu ga lungh, nah pe dade kideube teilu, dede kideube pecu cilu tadi. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Pa pekatei pe gume da gwang, nah pekatei pe gume pecu luulu tadi. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Dede pecu luu kelu leude, pe zi de nlum kelume, pa Tinggwang name teilu kebui mzeu peu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Aidungde hejai gade lunghgwang ma, mede pumteih lungning gade ma, mede mina lungning gade ma, dede Tinggwang dade. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Sambe mina mmi lwe anui kakga lungh. Anui pe kendu ngauda, pumlibe kendude ngaugia nah makesang le kepui tei eh Peibe dade kegwang de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:9">1 Jhn. 4:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />John pe zierang tei nah sah eh ranggai, “Aipaude Ih rang kebambe deda, ‘Pa a cai ga gwang kelabe au a swa diki, kedanemene pa au a dwa de la kedine.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kedanemene pe kepui de gade anui pelane ngaugia cia ngaugia de ngau luda. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kedanemene hezai au Moses dade kaibeu. Ngaugia nah kesangbe Jisu Khrista dade gwang. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Migede madaude Tinggwang de ngau ma. Kepumlibe nah Tinggwang, Peibe taiga kebambe, pane pecu ndulia gaibeu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John pa Jisu lie kecu mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />“Nang cauno?” de eh keteu kera Jerusalem gade Jewme reu kedimedung pe dage cingkumedung nah Levimedung de langkegai dau, John zierang aide da. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Pa kesangbe ranggai, nah pa mlai dima, dede kesangbe ranggai, “Ih au Khristabe ma.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Cine penui pecu keteu, “Iciu cai nang cauno? Nang Elijah ni?” Pa rang eh, “Ih au ma.” Penui rang eh, “Nang caihakeci ni?” Pa keligai, “Ma.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Pecai penui pe dade rangdi, “Nang cau no? Ciciu de anuide lang kegaime dage anui samli peulu kerane. Nkatei ncu de caulie rangla no?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Pa rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Ih au makwa ge, hetaideu gade sah kelade da:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Rampaube lampui de tei mzui lulo,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">Kesanglaisiu ga Isaiah caihakecibe kerang nzwa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Cu langkegaime kesade au Phariseeme ne langgai, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />nah penui pecu keteu nah pedade rangdi, “Nang Khrista ma mede Elijah de ma mede caihakecime ge de mecai, nang daitei mide duipum tei lano?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />John penui sam keli eh ranggai, “Ih au dui le duipum tei. Dede nnui kakga nnui ci kemak mige sap. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Pa au a caiga gwang kelabe deda, cipaude picum ria de Ih au hiaklu dui.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ma aidungde John mide duipum ketei Jordan reukung keda lambie Bethany gade teigwang.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang meurünna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Pecai benai John Jisu peda gwang kela ngaulu eh rangdi, “Pielo, luga Tinggwang Meurünna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang Meurünna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Meurünna” Jewmedung gilu nah Kahkegwang Ngyi ga tyeila Egyptme dade penuide kelikelu kensung gade, Exo. 12:3-11.</char></note> lada, kideube mau keugi kerabe de! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Aipau deda Ih, ‘A caiga mige gwangla pa au aswa diki, kedanemene pa a dwaga la kedine,’ de eh kerang de. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ih pecu cima, dede Ih dui le duipum tei gwang kecu au pecu Israelme dage lialu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />John pe zierang tei eh ranggai, “Ih Kemci Rabe tinggim gade tamhau ge nzwa hungkela ngau nah cide pereu ga bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Ih pecu cilu tadi, dede acu dui le mide duipum teilo langgai kebeube, pa a dage rangdi, ‘Caube reuga nang Rabe hung kela nah peda bam kedi ngau bi, pa au Kemci Rabe gade mide duipum tei kebambe deda.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ih ngau deda nah zierang tei gaila aipaude au Tinggwang Nabe lie kecu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lei. 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ledeukelume keraime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Pecia benai, John pe caisuime hangna de ngngwa sap bam daige, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />nah penui Jisu tet gwang kela ngaulu, ge John rangdi, “Pielo, Tinggwang Meurünnabe!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Pane ledeukelume hangna pa aide kerang siulu nah penai Jisu caisuidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Pecai Jisu nreu gwang ge penai pe caisui kela ngaulu nah penai dage rangdi, “Nnai dai luneu lano?” Cine penai pecu keli eh, “Rabbi (cide pwakedi kelu kiecai, keledeubo), nang daiga bam no?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Pa penai dage rangdi, “Gwang eh pielo.” Cine penai gwang eh pa kebam bam de ngaulu. Cipaunai penai pecu ngngwa bamdi, kedanemene cidau tinghegi bam mdaikenzwa ge kedi ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Penai hangge John makerang siulu delwe Jisu caisui kedibe au Andrew, Simon Peter sinabe. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Pa keraibe pe sinabe Simon de ngaulu delwe pedage rangdi, “Anui Messiah de ngau luda” (cide pwakedi kelu kiecai Khrista)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:25">Jhn. 4:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Pa pecu Jisu da ngngwa gwang beu, nah Jisu pecu piegai delwe rangdi, “Nang au John napei Simon. Ncu Cephas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cephas: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Syriacme let, Greekme let gade Peter pekie be nzwakap da, tangtsu.</char></note> qu zie.” (Cide pwakedi kedi cai Peter)<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Philip penai Nathaniel de qukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Pecai benai, Jisu Galilee deuceu ga miegai neudi, nah pa Philip de ngaulu eh pe dage rangdi, “Acai suilu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Cu Philip au Bethsaida namceu gade gwang, Andrew penai Peter nzwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Philip Nathaniel de ngaulu delwe pedage rangdi, “Moses nah caihakecimedung pe ha hezai gage rauteu kelabe de, anui pecu ngau luda: Jisu Joseph napei, Nazareth gade kegwangbe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:11">Mat. 21:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Dede Nathaniel pedade rangdi, “Nazareth gade makeyi gede pet lubui ni?” Philip pe dade rangdi, “Gwang eh pielo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Jisu Nathaniel peda gwang kela ngaulu delwe pe ha ranggai, “Pielo, Israelme kesang ge, peda au kenret gede gah!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nathaniel pedade rangdi, “Nang dainzwa acu cilu no?” Jisu keli gai nah pedade rangdi, “Philip ncu qulu kemak dwa, nang tangzüttsi bang kangga kebamdau, Ih ncu ngau da.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nathaniel pecu keligai, “Keledeubo, nang au Tinggwang Nabe da! Nang au Israelme Gwangpei da!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Jisu keligai eh pe dage rangdi, “Ih n dage, ‘Ih ncu tangzüttsi bang kang gade ngauda,’ de eh kerangde ziemne, nang nlumlu dini? Nang aiswade diki kecudung ngau zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:40">Jhn. 11:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Pecai pa pedade rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, nnui tinggimdung ngkei kedi, nah Tinggwang gwamedung Mina Nabe reuga nghang nghung kebam ngau zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Ken. 28:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Langcumne cai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Langcumne cai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Philip penai Nathaniel de qukelu cia.</char></note> Galilee deu ga Cana namceu ga meunui ge bam, nah Jisu pui cika bam. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Jisu nah pe caisuime de de meunui cikage qu gai pwabam. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Zau cang dige, Jisu pui pe dage rangdi, “Penui zau gah da.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Penui zau gah da”: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jewme lakta ngyi zai gade gwangkelume depeu matsi zau yitube sakla. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Dede Jisu pe dade rangdi, “Mipoi, cide anai ziemne daipai teilukera ge no? A ting gwangcang mereu lie.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ge pepui kilamedung dage rangdi, “Pa nnui dage rang kebeu leune, teilu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Cidau cika Jewme renet zai gade hui kemci ta ziemne tangtsu duibung herok dungpwa bam, cidung de ket ga gallon ngkai mecai camrei bam lula. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Duibungdung gage dui kaipui lu.” Cine penui cidungde pemung kecang tei puilu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Pecai pa kilamedung dage rangbeu, “Cu kesa twaklu delwe taktyeingyi mpaube de cide pwa peu lulo.” Iciu eh penui cinzwa teigai. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Cidau taktyeingyi mpaube zau mmi kedi dui cide msi kegai dau, (cu pa au cide dai gade gwang cilu ma, dede kilamedung dui ketwakme au cibam), taktyeingyi mpaube lakciube de qugai <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />delwe pedade rangdi, “Minaleune zau keyibe kaibeu rai lala nah penui sak mie kedi caine zau kelabe kaibeu la. Dede nang au cu kecang de zau keyibe kainzeu pwa bamreu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Aipau miswakegah ta raitube de Jisu Galilee Cana namceu gade teigai, nah pa pe kendu pwa liagai, nah pe caisuime pecu nlumlu.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kerecaki teikemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Aipau cai Jisu, nah pe pui, nah pe sinamedung, nah pe caisuime Capernaum ga hungdi nah cika penui tingbazie kie kemak ge bamdi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Cu Jewme gu kahkegwang ngyi ting gwang mnadi, cine Jisu Jerusalem ga hangdi. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Pa kerecaki ga hetum nah meurünna nah ruipuinedung zwa kebamme de ngaulu, nah rangkang rehiak kelame cika ntum bam. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Cine pa kedap ria ge teilu delwe kerecaki gade penui pelane de gwa mpetdi, meurünna nah hetum de si delwe. Pa rangkang rehiak kebamme rangkanggeudung tei zangra di nah penui gu rehiakbamdung kwak ngkumdi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ruipuine zwa kebamme dage, pa rangdi, “Ma aidung de aikade keu tetdi lulo. Apei ki lepwa litakni teita dilu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Pa ne ledeukelume, “Ih n ki ziemne nrisüt kegai dene acu teinggah dizie,” de eh raupwa kebam de nsunglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Lei. 69:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Iciu ge kengkieng teu kebam Jewme reu kedimedung pe sam keligai nah rangdi, “Nang aide tei kebamde ziemne, nang daipai rehi ge anuide liagai zieno?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Ge Jisu penui sam keligai eh rangdi, “Kerecaki aide tei msiadi lulo, nah langcumne gage Ih cide teu ncuh dai dizie.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Ge kengkieng teu kela Jewme reu kedimedung rangdi, “Kerecaki aide mmi riakdai herok gage teilu, nah nang aide langcumne gage kwak ncu dailu zie lieni?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Dede, pa au pe pum recaki ha rangbam. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ciziemne, pecu ketsai gade kwak cuh kedi cai, pe caisuimedung pa aide de rang kenzeu de nsunglu, nah penui kesanglaisiu de nah Jisu kerang aide nlumlu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Cu pa Jerusalem ga Kahkegwang Ngyi ga kela dau, pa marehidung tei kegai ngau luge mina kekie pezi gade nlumlu. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Dede Jisu penuide nlumlu tadi kedanemene pa penui pelane de ci ciak kebamne. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Migede de peu peda mina zierang tei maisia ma, kedanemene mina lungga dai bam bi kecu pa au ci kecune.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Jisu Nicodemus de keledeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Cidau Phariseeme kakga mipei ge pezi Nicodemus lie kecuge bamla, Jewme muiteume ge. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Aipau pei de tingmui Jisu da gwang nah pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang au Tinggwang dade gwang kela keledeube kecu anui ci lie, kedanemene nang tei kebam marehidung aide au migede tei gailak Tinggwang pecu ngngwa la melie cai.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Jisu keligai nah pe dage rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, mige mna heci dailu meliecai, pa Tinggwang hegwangram ngau gailak.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nicodemus pe dage rangdi, “Dainzwa mige pa cing kedi caine mna dailu lai? Pa pe pui henabam ga pekenabe nlüt dai eh dainzwa mna dailu lai?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Jisu keligai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, mige dui nah Rabe gade mna lu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dui nah Rabe gade mna lu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide “duipum” tei kecu de rangbam.</char></note> kemaktane, pa Tinggwang hegwangram ga nlüt gailak. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Pumteihbe gade mna kelube au pumteihbe da, nah Rabe gade mna kelube au rabe da. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ih n dage ‘Nang mna heci dailu maisia’, de eh rang kegai ziemne nswa gah di so. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Tingkai pesui gage guigai bamla, nah nang pekwa siula, dede nang cide dai gade gwangla bi mede dai gage tetgaila bi kecu ci ma. Mileune de Rabe gade mna kelume au cinzwa da.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 11:5">Kel. 11:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nicodemus pe dage keteugai, “Ma aidungde dainzwa teilu zieno?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Jisu keligai, “Nang Israel ga keledeume ge ni, nah nang aidungde ci mene lareu ni? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, anui kecibe anui rangla, nah anui kengaube ha zierang teila. Iciude nnui anui zierang luu luma. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ih nnuide kideube hadung ranglia nah nnui nlumlu mecai, magade Ih nnuide tinggim hadung ranglia de nnui dainzwa nlum lulai? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Migede tinggim ga nghang ma tinggim gade kenghungbe de, Mina Nabe gwale. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Moses hetaideu gade henei de pwacuh kecu nzwa eh, Mina Nabe dede pwacuh maisia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Pum. 21:9</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 8:28">Jhn. 8:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />iciude pecu nlum kelume leune kelungta kering ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Tinggwang kideube de hungzu kecune, pe Na kepumlibe de pa kaibeu, iciu eh pecu nlum kelu keheibe de kap eh gah dilak dede kelungta kering ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kedanemene kideube de mmau kerane Tinggwang Nabe de kideu gage langgai ma, dede pe dade kideube de kelilu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Pecu nlum kelume de mmau di lama, dede nlumlu kemakme de au mmau bam dida kedanemene pa Tinggwang Na kepumlibe zi gade nlum kemakne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:10">Jhn. 5:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Dede hetu ketiak aipau kiede ziemne da: Kebaabe kideu ga gwang da, nah minadung kebaabe de swade kemuibe de hungki di kedanemene penui batadung kesiade ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kedanemene kesia tei kela leune kebaabe de ngkaula, nah kebaa ga gwang lamah, iciude pe batadung let mpetdi kelak ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Iciuliede, mige kesang tei kelabe kebaa da gwangla iciu eh cide Tinggwang gade pe batadung tei kegai mci hegi eh ngaulu kerane.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duipumketeibe John Jisu ha kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Aipaucai, Jisu nah pe caisuimedung Judea deu ga gwang di. Cika pa penuide tingkakge ngngwa bamdi nah duipum tei. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Pecai heni ge Salim taiga Aenon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aenon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Enon,” mede “Aenon,” aide pekie “duilet”.</char></note> lie qukela ga John de duipum teibam kedanemene cika dui kiee kebamne. Minadung peda gwang bam nah duipum teibam, <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />John de hebaangki gage kaigai mereu kecune. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ge John caisuimedung mikangge nah Jewme ge kakga hui kemci zaidung ha gade kesamlim cuhdi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Cine penui John da mie delwe pedade rangdi, “Keledeubo, ncu nzang eh Jordan Reuki lulegim ga kelabe de, nang pe zierang tei kebambe de, pielo, pa duipum tei bam dida, nah penui pelane pe dage tetgai bam dida.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />John keligai eh rangdi, “Migede magede ngaugai lak Tinggim gade cide pecu pwapeu mecai. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Nnuine de a dage zierang teiluibui, ‘Ih au Khrista ma,’ dede meliene, ‘Acu Pe dwa lang nswa gai,’ de eh Ih rang kegai de. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Lakciube puide ngau kelube lakciube delie. Cu lakciube zangme, sap eh pe kwa kingnei kebambe de, pesuiyi sütlu lakciube kwa siu kelune. Ciziemne a suiyi aide tei canglu da. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Pa au di reureu maisia, dede Ih au ceu reureu maisia.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mige nreule de kegwangbe au pekiene reube lie. Mige kideu gade kegwangbe au kideu gade nah kideube ha rang la. Mige tinggim gade kegwangbe au pekiene reube lie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:23">Jhn. 8:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Pa au pa ngau kelube nah siu kelube ha zierang tei la, dede migede pe zierang luulu ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Mige pe zierang luulu kelube Tinggwang au kesanglie kecu cisiakte luda. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Kedanemene Tinggwang mige de lang kegaibe de Tinggwang samdung rangla. Kedanemene Pa Rabe de mdet eh kaibeu melu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Peibe Nabe de hungla nah ma pelane pwa peba gage kaibeu dida. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Mige Nabe de nlum kelube au kelungta kering ngaulu da, dede mige Nabe samzai teilu kemakbe au kering ngau gailak, dede Tinggwang lungkabe pe da bam dizie.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Jisu Samariame pui de kempau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Cu Jisu pa John swade ledeukelume kiee nah duipum teibeu kiee gwa kebam Phariseeme siukelu ci keludau <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(Jisu pekatei au duipum tei meliede, dede pe caisuimedung ne tei bam), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />pa Judea deu pütdi delwe Galilee ga cailigwang daidi. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Dede pa Samaria deu gade tetkah gwang maisia di. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Cine pa Samaria ga Jacob ne pe na Joseph de kepeube deu ge taiga Sychar lie kecu nam ga gwanglu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Cu Jacob tekwa cika bam. Jisu Pe beu gade leu la kedine, pa tekwa tai ga ntumbam. Cide tingna tingding dau ge. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Samariame pui ge dui twak kera gwanglu, nah Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Acu dui sak kera kesa peulo,” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Pe caisuimedung namceu ga taktyei lui kera mie kedine. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Pecai Samariame pui pe dage rangdi, “Dainzwa delwe, nang, Jewme gele, a dade, Samariame pui ge dade dui sak kera kiebam no?” Kedanemene Jewme Samariame de ngngwa magede teila kemakne. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Jisu pecu keligai nah rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang mapeu de nah n dade, ‘Acu dui sak kera peu lo,’ de rang kebambe de cau bi ci liecai, nang pe dade kie zie nage, nah pa ncu keringdui pwapeu zie nage.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mipuibe pedade rangdi, “Kedibo, nang duibung ge de gah nah tekwa de cukbam. Cine keringdui de nang daiga de ngaulu zie no? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Anui pei Jacob, anuide tekwa kepeube, nah tekwa cipaude gade pekatei de sak da, pe namedung nah pe kauhau de kesak nzwa, nang pe swade diki lie lani?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Jisu keligai eh pe dage rangdi, “Keheibe de dui aide gade sak kelube hereu dai dizie, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />dede keheibe de Ih pecu dui pwapeu zielie kela gade saklu cai madau gede hereu dailak. Meliene, Ih pecu pwapeu zielie kela dui cide au peda duilet ge tei dizie, cide lwapwa kelungta kering duilet ge dizie.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mipuibe pedade rangdi, “Kedibo, dui aide acu peulo iciu eh Ih madaude hereu dai melu kerane nah aika gwang eh dui twak dai melu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Jisu pedade rangdi, “Miecu, n nahpei de qulu, delwe aika cailigwanglo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mipuibe keligai nah pedade rangdi, “Ih a nahpei gede gah lie.” Jisu pecu keligai, “Nang petaulie, ‘Ih a nahpei gah,’ de eh kerang de, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />kedanemene nang n nahpei hang mengei bam dida, nah nang cu ngngwa kebamde au n nahpei ma. Nang kerang de au kesangda.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mipuibe pe dade rangdi, “Kedibo, nang au caihakecime ge kecu Ih ci luda. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Anui peimedung lamlwa aipaude gade recala, dede nnui minadung Jerusalem gade reca lie rangla.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Hez. 11:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Jisu pe dade rangdi, “Acu nlumlu, mipui bo, nnui Peibe de lamlwatu aide gade mede Jerusalem gade reca tadi kera pe bamdakkak gwangzeu da. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nnui ci kemakbe de nnui reca. Anui ci kelabe de reca, kedanemene, kelikelu au Jewme dade lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa. 2:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Iciuliede, bamdapkak gwangzeu da, nah cu aika bam dida, kesang tei eh reca kelamedung Peibe de rabe nah kesang gade reca dizie, kedanemene Peibe de mina cinzwa pecu reca kelamedung de peei lalu. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Tinggwang au Rabe, nah minadung pecu reca kelame rabe nah kesangbe gade reca maisia.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mipuibe pedade rangdi, “Messiah au gwangla kecu Ih cibam (Khrista lie qu kelabe de). Pa kegwang dau, pa anuide maleune ranglia beuzie.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Jisu pe dade rangdi, “Ih pa da, ncu mpau kebambe de.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ledeukelume Jisu de redau daikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Cipau tingdau pe caisuime cailigwang lu. Cu penui pa mipui gede mpau kebam ne penui swa gahdi, dede migede, “Nang dai luuneu lano?” mede, “Nang daitei pecu kempau bamno?” de eh rangma. <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Cine mipuibe pe duibung pütdi, nah namceu ga caili gwang di, nah minadung dage ranggai, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Gwang pie lulo, Ih tei kedidung leune acu ranglia ciak kebeube peide. Pa Khristabe lubui deni?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Penui namceu pütdi delwe peda gwanglu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Cipau tingdau, ledeukelumedung pecu, “Keledeubo, matyei lulo,” de eh kecung bam. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Dede pa penui dade rangdi, “Nnui ci kemakpe Ih taktyei tyei kera bam.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Cine ledeukelumedung hangge ge dade rangdi, “Kangge pecu magede tyei kera teugwang beuni?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Jisu penui dade rangdi, “A ketyeipok au acu lang kegaibe lungning Ih tei kera nah pe bata teicang kerade da. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nnui rang meluini, ‘Kei mdai bam si reu nah pecai luhlüt ting gwang zie? de eh. Pielo, Ih au nnui dage rangbam, nnui ngangcuh eh luhdung pielo, cidungde meu pwa rumlu kebui bamdi delu! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Luhlüt kelame ziehidung ngau lula nah matsi kelungta kering ziemne hekwa lula, iciu eh ling kegaibe de nah rum kegaibe de suiyi ngngwa mzi nsamlu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kedanemene sam rang kela aide kesang lie, ‘Mige ling gaibam, nah mi kedage rum bam.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:15">Mic. 6:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ih nnuide nnui bata teigai kemak gage rum lulo langgai dida. Kedame ne bata teigai da, nah nnui penui bata tei kegai ga lüt dida.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Namdi cika Samariame mina kekiee ge pecu nlumlu, mipuibe de, “Ih tei kedi leune pa acu ranglia siakte da,” de eh zierang tei kegai de pau kebeu ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Cine Samariamedung peda gwang kelu dau, penui pe dade penui da bam lulo kiedi, ge pa cika langnane bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Mina kekieege nlum si lu pe sam de ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Penui mipuibe dade rangdi, “Nang rang kegai de ziemne anui nlum kelube ma, kedanemene anui anuikatei de pe siulu da, nah anui ci luda mina aide kideube de Kelikelube kesang lie kecu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kedime na gede teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Cipau langnane cai, pa cikade Galilee deu gage tetgaidi. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kedanemene Jisu pekatei de caihakecibe ge au pekatei pe deudi ga kerüt ngaula melie kecu ranggai delu. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Cine pa Galilee ga gwang kelu dau, Galileeme pecu ngngwa lu. Jerusalem ga hengyi dau pa tei kegai leune penui ngaulu, kedanemene penui de hengyi cide ga mie kecu ziemne.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Cu pa Galilee ga Cana deu ga gwang dailu, pa dui le zau tei kegaibe nam ga. Cika mige hegwangki ga heta ketei kedime ge pe napei Capernaum ga nra bam. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Pa Jisu Judea gade Galilee ga gwang kebam siu luge, pa Jisu da mie delwe pecu gwang eh pe napei de tei hemi beulo kiedi, kedanemene pa tsailai eh kebamne. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Pecai Jisu pedade rangdi, “Nnui marehidung nah miswakegahdung ngau kemaktane nnui nlum lak.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:2">Dan. 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kedibe de pedade rangdi, “Kedibo, a na tsai di kemak dwa ge hung beulo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Jisu pedade rangdi, “Miecu. N na ring luzie.” Mipei de Jisu pe dage rang kegai sam de nlumlu, nah pa tetdi. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Dede pa tet nghungla kezeu dau, pe kilamedung pecu redaulwe pe na ringbam liede pecu paubeu. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Cine pa penui dade daipau tingdau pa yi gwanglu dino keteu di. Cine penui pecu keligai, “Nziene bam ge tingdau kenra de pe dade gahdi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ge pe pei cipau tingsiak dau Jisu pe dade, “N na ring luzie,” de rang kebeu de nsunglu. Cine pa nah pe kilungme pelane nlumlu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Jisu Judea gade Galilee mpet kelu cai miswakegah bata tei kegai aide pe kenabe da.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Rejai gade teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Aipau cai Jewme hengyi ge bam, nah Jisu Jerusalem ga hangdi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Cu Jerusalem ga meurünna kirieki taiga, tekwa ge bam, cide Hebrewme let gade Bethesda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethesda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaugia ki. Teeinei kecudung teihemi kecu ngkieng süt kecune cinzwa qudi.</char></note> de qu la, nah cika kigu lim kelu mengei bam. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mina kekiee ge teeineime, miakcitme, keswame mede kemnoime cika zeu bamla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukwak kehegwa yitube ga samkie aide bamma, </char><char style="fqa">dui lwamie kecu kwabam. </char> </note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />[Kedanemene Rampaube tinggimgwame ge peting ge tei eh nghung tekwa dui tei kenuak gai lala nah dui kenuak kebam dau keheibe de dui ga tetlüt kelube pa teei eh reei kebam mateei keheibe gade yi lula]. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Cu mige mmi camreieheset ge mateeila kedi kauge bam. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Jisu pa cika zeu kebam ngau luge, nah pa peting ketie ge cika bam kedi pa ci kelu cai, pa pe dade rangdi, “Nang yi lu neuni?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Teei kebambe de pecu keligai, “Kedibo, Ih au migede a taiga gah, cide dui kenuak kegai dau, pa acu tekwa gage kaigai beulu kerane. Dede Ih lüt kezeu dau, kedame ge a dwa ga lüt dila.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Jisu pedade rangdi, “Cuhlu, n zeu pwalu, delwe tetlu.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Zette mipei cide yilu, nah pa pe zeu pwa culwe tetdi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Cu cipau nai de au Sabbath nai. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Cine Jewme reu kedimedung yi kelube pei dade rangdi, “Henai au Sabbath nah n zeu pwa kera ncu hezai peu ma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer. 17:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Dede pa penuide keligai, “Acu tei hemi kebeube, pa a dade ranggai, ‘N nzeu keulwe tet lulo,’” de eh. <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Penui pe dade keteu gai, “N dade, ‘Keu ncuhlu delwe tet lulo,’ de eh kerabe peide cau no?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Iciude, yi kelube pei cide caubi cilu ma kedanemene Jisu ngkimkak eh tet kedine, kedanemene heni dega mina maadi ge kebamne. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Cipaucai, Jisu pecu kerecaki ga bam eh ngaulu nah pe dade rangdi, “Pielo, nang yingkei luda! Kemau teisi ta lulo, iciu eh ma aiswa siaki kecube n da gwang di melu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Mipei de tetdi nah Jewme reu kedimedung dage pecu teingkei kebeube Jisu lie de eh pau beu.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nabe gade kering</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Cu ma aidungde ziemne Jewme reu kedime Jisu de teitset kera mmau cuhdi, kedanemene pa Sabbath zai gikah kedi ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Dede Jisu penuide keligai, “A Pei au cude matei bam, nah Ih de ma teibam lie.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ma aide ziemne, Jewme reu kedime pecu teitset kera peei kidi kedanemene pa Sabbath de gihleu kegai rünne ma, dede Tinggwang dede pe Pei lie qu eh pekatei pecu Tinggwang nsam tei kedine.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Cine Jisu penui sam keligai nah penui dade rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Nabe pekatei rünne magede teigai lak, Peibe tei kebamde ngau kelube rünne gwale, kedanemene, Peibe teikela leune, Nabe de cidungde tei kelane. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kedanemene, Peibe Nabe de hungla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Peibe Nabe de hungla: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang pena kepumlibe ziemne madaude gahdi kelak keku, cet canggai kelak, yitube.</char></note> nah pa pekatei tei kela pelane pwa pecu liala, nah pa pecu ma aidung de swa diki kecube liagai zie, iciu eh nnui swagah dilu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kedanemene Peibe ketsaime de kwakcuh nah penuide kering peu kela nzwa, cinzwa eh Nabe de kering pwa pa peu keneube de pwa peula. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Kedanemene Peibe de migede de tiak lamah, dede tiak kera pelane pa Nabe de pwapeu dida <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />iciu eh mileune de Nabe de rütlu kerane penui Peibe de rüt kela nzwa eh. Mige Nabe de rütla kemakme pecu lang kegaibe Peibe de de rütla ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, keheibe de a sam siulu eh acu lang kegaibe de nlumlu cai pa kelungta kering ngaulu da nah tutiak bam ga gwang dilak, dede pa ketsai gade kaa pet kering ga bam dida. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, ketsaimedung Tinggwang Nabe kwa siu kera ting gwangla dida nah cude gwangbam dida, nah siu kelume ring luzie. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kedanemene Peibe peda kering kebam kesiakge pa Nabe dede peda kering bam kera pwapeu dida, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />nah pa Nabe de tutiak tei kera kengkieng pwapeu dida, kedanemene pa au Mina Nabe kecune. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Aide ziemne nnui swa gah diso, kedanemene heraudung ga kebamme leune de pe kwa siu kera peting ge gwang zeu delu <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nah mpet zie. Keyi keteime kering gage ringcuh gaizie, nah kesia keteime tutiak gage ringcuh gaizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Ih akatei magede tei gailak. Ih siukelu nzwa, Ih tiak la, nah Ih tiak kelade masang kedanemene Ih au akatei asuibe tei lamah dede acu lang kegaibe suibe teila.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe ha rangkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ih magade akatei a ha zierang teizie cai, a zierang cide kesangbe melubui. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />A ha zierang tei kelabe mikedage bam, nah a ha zierang pa tei kela de au kesang lie kecu Ih ci. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nnui John dage langgai da, nah pa kesangbe zierang tei beu da. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Cu Ih zierang ngau kebam de au mina dade ma. Dede Ih ma aidung kerang au peu nnuide kelilu kera ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />John au mitaubung ge heu nah baa kebam ge nah nnui tingkakke ziemne pe kebaa gade nnui suiyi eh bam neu di. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Iciude zierang ada kebam de au John da kebam swade diki, kedanemene Peibe acu teilo heta pwapeu kebeu de Ih cidungde teicang lu maisia, nah Ih tei kebam heta aide, Peibe acu langgai lie kecu a zierang teila. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Peibe acu lang kegaibe pa pekatei de a zierang tei da. Nnui madaude pe kwa de siu ma, mede pe rehi de ngau ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Nnui pe samdung nnui da bamsi meda, kedanemene pa lang kegaibe de nnui nlumlu kemakne. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nnui kesanglaisiudung peei la kedanemene nnui cidung gade kelungta kering ngaulu lalie kecu cet la, nah kesanglaisiudung aidungde ne a zierang teila, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />nah nnui ada gwang neu tadi iciu eh nnui kering ngaulu kera. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Ih mina dade hetwa ngau la ma, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />dede Ih nnui de ci, Tinggwang kehung nnui da la kemak de. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ih a Pei zi teu eh gwangla, nah nnui acu ngngwa luma. Mige pekatei pezi gade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mige pekatei pezi gade: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide Satan de rangbam. </char></note> gwang zie liecai, nnui pecu luu luzie. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Nnui dainzwa nlumlu lai, nnui hangge ge dade hetwa luulu kelamedung dede ket rünne kecube Tinggwang dade kegwang hetwa de peeila kemak cai? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Ih ne Peibe dwagade nnuide mmau zielie kecu cet selo. Nnuide mmau kecube au nnui keregui kaipwa kenzeube Moses lie. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Kedanemene magade nnui Moses de nlumcai, nnui acude nlumlu kerabe nage, kedanemene pa a ha Kesanglaisiu gage raugai kecune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luk. 24:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Dede nnui pa raukegai dungde nlum mecai, dainzwa eh nnui a samdung nlum lulai?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Jisu mina cang mengei pukketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Aidungde cai, Jisu Galilee duidi lulegim Tiberias duidi lie eh de qukela ga miedi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Cidau mina maadi ge pecai sui ladi kedanemene penui pa teeineei kelame dage marehidung tei kebam ngau kelune<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Marehidung tei kebam ngau kelune: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Penui ngaulu peda kengkieng bam kecu penui luneu kebam pwa peulu kebui, ciziemne penui pecai suila.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Jisu lamlwa ga nghang nah pa cika pe caisuimedung de ngngwa ntum lu. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />(Cu kahkegwang, Jewme ngyi ting de, nnadi). <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Jisu mina maadi ge peda gwangla kedi pa ngau luge, pa Philip dage rangdi, “Dai gade anui tangku luilai aidungde de peu tyeilu kera?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />(Dede Jisu Philip de kedakpie kerane aide ranggai, kedanemene Philip daipai tei laubi pa ci kebamne.) <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Philip pe sam keligai, “Penui ziemne tangku denarii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denarii ket au pe zie tei eh langnai ge mata teikelame ge zie nsam. </char></note> haina mi liede cam zie, hangge ge dage kecamna ge peu gwang zie liede.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Pe caisuime hangge, Simon Peter sinabe Andrew, Jisu dade rangdi, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Aika mipeina ge da barley tangku mengei nah heka kena lalie, dede mina kekiee kakte ainade daige zieno?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Jisu ranggai, “Minadung de peu ntum bamlu.” (Cu heni cika au tsehei kekiee ge bam.) Cine mipeidung ntum lu, pumpei cang mengei kenzwa ge. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Pecai Jisu tangkudung keulu eh Tinggwang de hetwa peukelu cai, pa cide ntum kebammedung de peugai. Pa heka de cinzwa peugai, penui tyei keneu kiee ge. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Minadung nggei luge, pa ledeukelumedung dage ranggai, “Bang keludung de keu hekwalu, iciu eh magede peu ngkapdi melu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Cine penui cidungde keu hekwalu nah barley tangku mengei tyei kelume ne tyeibangh kelu gade hebie kereiekena teipui lu. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Cidau, minadung marehi aide pa tei kegai ngau luge, penui rangdi, “Aide caihakecibe kesangbe da, kideu ga gwang lai eh kebambe de.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:11">Mat. 21:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Penui kemei tei eh pecu tuilwe pecu peu hegwang teidi kera gwang lai zeu lie kecu Jisu cilu ge, pa tet nreudai eh lamlwa ga pekatei nghang di.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu dui reuga ketet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Tinghegi gwang luge, Pe caisuimedung jaaidi ga hungdi. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Penui liem ge ga lütlu, nah jaaidi tetkah eh Capernaum nam gage tet gaidi. Cidau tingmuidi, dede Jisu penuida gwanglu mene ladi. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Tingkai cisüt ge guibam, nah jaaidi de nswak bam di. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Penui liem taupwa stadia ngkaiemengei mede camrei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Stadia ngkaiemengei mede camrei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilometer mengei kenzwa ge.</char></note> ge mie dige, penui Jisu dui reuga tet kela nah liem ga gwang mna kezeu ngau lu, nah penui ngngi di. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Dede pa penui dage ranggai, “Aide Ih lie! Ngngi di so.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ge penui pecu liem gage ngngwa gailu neu di, nah zette eh penui gwang zielie kela deu ga liem gwang cang lu.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Pecai benai, mina maadi jaaidi lulegim sap kebammedung liem ket gwale keda gede bam kemak nah Jisu pe caisuimedung de ngngwa liem dega nlüt kemak, dede pe caisuimedung pecu ngngwa mene tet kedi ngaulu. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Dede, liemdung Tiberias gade Rampaube ne hetwa peu kegai cai penui tangku ketyei ni taiga gwanglu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ciziemne hemaabe Jisu de nah pe caisuimedung de cika bam kemak ci luge, penui penui katei ne liemdung ga nlütlu delwe Jisu de peei eh Capernaum ga miedi.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu au kering tangkube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Penui duidi lulegim ga pecu ngaukelu cai, penui pe dage rangdi, “Keledeubo, nang daidau aika gwanglu no?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Jisu penuide keli eh ranggai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, nnui acu peeila, nnui marehidung ngau kecune ma, dede nnui tangkudung kesa tyeilu nah nggei kelu ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Gahdi kela ketyeipuk ziemne heta tei so, dede Mina Nabe nnuide peu zielie kela taktyeipuk kelungta kering gage liacang lu kebui de ziemne teilu, kedanemene Peibe Tinggwang ne pedage pe giak dapti delu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Pecai penui pedade rangdi, “Anui daipai tei maisia no, iciu eh anui Tinggwang tadung tei lu kerane?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Jisu penui sam keligai eh penui dade rangdi, “Tinggwang ta au aide da: Cide nnui pa lang kegaibe de nlumlu kera deda.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Cine penui pe dage rangdi, “Iciucai nang marehi daipai teilia lai no, iciu eh anui ngau eh ncu nlumlu kerane? Nang daipai tei zie no? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Anui peime hetaideu ga manna tyei eh gwang, cide Kesanglaisiu ga rauteu kela nzwa, ‘Pa penuide tangku tyei kera tinggim gade peu.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:24">Lei. 78:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Ge Jisu penui sam keligai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Moses ne tangku cide nnuide tinggim gade peu ma, dede a pei ne tangku kesangbe nnuide tinggim gade peu bam. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kedanemene Tinggwang gu tangku au tinggim gade kehungbe nah cide kideube de kering pwapeu la.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Cine penui pe dade rangdi, “Kedibo, anuide tangku aide peu muilo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Ih au kering tangkube da;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih au kering tangkube da: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu aide rang kecu pa au rabe teilung ngha beu kelabe mede pe keledeudung kering peu zie nah keringria de lungciep peu zie.</char></note> caudungge a da gwanglu dibi pa mzeu dilak, nah acu nlum kelube madaude hereu dai dilak. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Dede Ih nnuide rangbeu da nnui acu ngau kesangda, nah nnui nlum lak. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Mileune de Peibe acu kepeube a da gwang zie, nah a da gwang kelume de Ih kelien gidi lakzing. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kedanemene Ih tinggim gade hung bam, a lungning be tei kera ziemne ma, dede acu lang kegaibe lungning tei kera ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Acu lang kegaibe pe lungning au aide da, iciu eh pa acu pwa kepeu pelane hangge dede Ih teinggah dilak, dede pecu kamtube tingba benai teucuh beu zie. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kedanemene aide Peibe lungning da, mileune de Nabe de ngaulwe pecu nlum kelube kelungta kering ngaulu zie, nah Ih pecu kamtube tingba benai teucuh luzie.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ge Jewmedung, “Ih tinggim gade hung kelu tangkube da,” de pa rang kegai ziemne pecu ncam di. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Cine penui kakde rangdi, “Aide Jisu Joseph napei, anui pe pei nah pe pui de ci kebam de meni? Iciu eh dainzwa pa cu, ‘Ih tinggim gade hung kelabe da’ de ranglubui no?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Jisu penui dage keligai nah rangdi, “Nnui kakte ncam kebam de mtaklu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Migede a da gwang gailak Peibe acu lang kegaibe ne pecu teu teugwang beu kemaktane, nah Ih pecu kamtube tingba benai teucuh luzie. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Kesanglaisiu ga rau kenzeu, ‘Nah Tinggwang ne mileune de ledeu beuzie.’ Mileune Peibe dade siu nah ci kelube a da gwang zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa. 54:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Migede Peibe de ngau ma, Tinggwang dade kegwangbe rünne gwale, pa Peibe de ngau da. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, nlum kelube kelungta kering bam dida. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ih au kering tangkube da. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Nnui paume renaamkang gade manna tyei da, delwe penui tsai dida. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Tangku aide tinggim gade kehungbe, iciu eh mige cide keceuna ge tyei lu delwe tsai dilak. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ih tinggim gade kegwang ringkela tangkube da. Keheibe de tangku aide ketyeime kelungta ring luzie. Ih kideube ringlukera ziemne peulai kezeu tangkube au a pumteihbe da.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ge Jewmedung penui kakte kesamlim cuhdi, “Dainzwa eh aipau pei de pe pumteih tyei kera peu zielie zeu no de rangdi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ge Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, nnui mina Nabe teih tyeilu kemaktane nah pe jai sak kemaktane, kering nnuida bam gailak. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />A teih tyei nah a jai sak kelube kelungta kering bam dida, nah Ih pecu kamtube nai teucuh beuzie. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kedanemene, a teih au taktyei kesangbe da, nah a jai au sakkela kesangbe da. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />A teih tyei nah a jai sak kelube a da bam, nah Ih pe da bam. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ringkela Peibe acu lang kegai nzwa, nah Ih Peibe ziemne ring kebam nzwa, cine a cu tyei kelume, pa de a ziemne ringlu zie. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Tangku aide tinggim gade nghung kebambe, paumedung tyeilwe tsai kedibe de ma. Tangku aide tyei kelume kelungta ring luzie.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Jisu Capernaum ga ledeu kebam dau synagogue (ngqwaki) gade pa ma aidungde rangdi.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caisuime kekieege Jisu de pütkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ge pe caisuimedung aide siu kelume kekiee ge rangdi, “Keledeu sam aide whung zu; caune aide luulubui no?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Jisu, pe caisuimedung aide ncam kedi pa pekatei ci kedine, penui dade rangdi, “Sam aide ne nnuide tei ngkung dini? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Iciucai dainzwa lai magade nnui Mina Nabe ndaa kebam ga nghang daidi eh ngau liecai?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 47:5">Lei. 47:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Kering peu kelabe au Rabe; pumteihbe au magede kemmi gah. Ih nnui dage rang kegai samdung de au Rabe lie, nah cidungde au keringria lie. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Dede nnui kakga nlum kemakme midungge bamreu.” Kedanemene Jisu au raitu gade caugamme pecu nlum lakbi nah caube ne pecu tuigai beu ziebi cibam. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Cine pa rangdi, “aide ziemne, Ih nnui dage rangla migede a da gwang gailak Peibe ne gwang kera pecu peu mecai.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Aide ziemne, pe caisuimedung kekiee ge caisimdi, nah pecu ngngwa tetsi tadi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ge Jisu kereiekenabau dade rangdi, “Nnuide tetdi neu lani?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simon Peter pecu keligai, “Rampaubo, anui cau dage tet gailai? N da kelungta kering samdung la, <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />nah anui nang au Tinggwang dade kegwang Kemcibe lie kecu nlum nah cibam dida.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Ih ne nnui de kedet lu meluini, kereiekena bau, nah nnui kakte mi hangge herakesiabe da?” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Pa Simon Iscariot napei Judas ha rangbam, kedanemene kereiekenabau kakde, Jisu de tuih gaibeu kerabe de pa da.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Jisu hadung ngyi ga kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Pecai, Jisu Galilee deu ga mbeuh ladi, Pa Judea ga gwang neu tadi kedanemene Jewme pecu teitset ti zielie peei la kedine. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Cidau Jewme Hengyi kela Kensiungyi nnadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev. 23:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Ciziemne pe sinamedung pe dage rangdi, “Heni aide pütdi delwe Judea ga miecu, ciu eh n caisuimedung de peu nang tei kela tadung ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Kedanemene migede magede ngkim eh tei lamah pa pekatei pecu peu mdu neu cai. Nang ma aidung de teila cai, nkatei ncu kideube de lia lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Kedanemene pe sinamedung liede pecu nlum kemakne. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ciziemne Jisu penui dage rangdi, “A ting gwangcang mereu, dede nnui ting au mtei pwabam muila. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Kideube nnui de ngkau gailak, dede cide acu ngkau kedanemene Ih cide pe batadung sialie eh rang kecu ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nnui hengyi ga mie culo; Ih au hengyi aide ga mie lak kedanemene a ting cang mereu lu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Pa ma aidung de penui dage rang kelu cai, pa Galilee ga bamdi.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Dede cidau pe sinamedung hengyi ga hang di ge, pecai pa de hang, mi miakngau tei mene dede ngkim eh. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Cidau, hengyi gade Jewme reu kedimedung pecu peei la nah ranggai, “Pa daiga bamno?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Cika maadi kakga pe ha rang popbak di. Midungge rangdi, “Pa au mina keyime ge.” Dede kedame rangdi, “Ma, dede pa hemaabe de teu kebwakla.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Dede Jewme reu kedime de kengngi ziemne migede pe ha rang mdu tadi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu hengyi gade keledeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Hengyi sumge ga cangla kedi dau, Jisu kerecaki ga nghang lu nah ledeu cuh di. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ge Jewmedung penui swaga eh, ranggai, “Mina aide dainzwa kesanglaisiu cilu dino, kedanemene pa laisiu kecime gede ma?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Ge Jisu penui sam keli eh rangdi, “A keledeu au agu ma, dede acu lang kegaibe pe dade gwang. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Magade keheibe de pe lungning teineu lacai, pa ci luzie keledeu aide ha, Tinggwang dade gwang mi, mede Ih akatei a dade rangla bi kecu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Pekatei pe dade rang kelabe pekatei pe kendu peeila, dede pecu langkegaibe dade kendu peei kelabe au kesangbe da, nah peda masangkemak bam ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moses nnui de hezai kai beu meni? Dede nnui migede hezai mzai ma. Daiziemne nnui acu teitset kera peeila no?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Hemaa be sam keli, “N da herakesia ge la. Cau ncu teitsetdi zielie peeila no?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Jisu sam keli eh penui dage rangdi, “Ih mata ge teilu, nah cide ziemne nnui pelane swaga di. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Aide ziemne, Moses hegeukerum zai nnui de peu (cide au Moses dade ma, dede nnui paumedung dade), nah Sabbath benai nnui mige geu rumla. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Mige Sabbath benai hegeurum lu liede Moses zai gileu di melie cai, Ih Sabbath benai migede teihemi cangsiak kegai ziemne daitei acu nnui rata lano? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Hegwazu gade mide hetiak tei so, dede makesangbe gade tiaklu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu au Khristabe deni?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ge Jerusalem gade kangge rangdi, “Aide penui teitsetdi zielie peei kelabe de meni? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Pielo, pa haibena dwaga marang, nah penui pe dage magede rang ma. Kedimedung kesangbe penui aide Khristabe delie kecu cimah, penui cibam deni? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Dede anui au mina aipaude dai gade gwang bi kecu cibam. Dede Khrista gwang kecudau, migede pa dai gade gwang bam bi kecu ci gailak.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ge Jisu kerecaki gade mide ledeu eh sahbak eh ranggai, “Nnui acu de cibam nah Ih au dai gade gwang bi cibam. Ih akatei gwang ma, dede pa acu lang kegaibe au kesangbe, nnui pecu ci ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ih pecu ci, kedanemene Ih au pe dade gwang nah pa ne acu langgai.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Cine penui pecu tui kera tei bam di, dede migede heba pereu gage kaigai ma kedanemene pe bamdakkak gwangcang mereu kecune. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Dede mina maadi ga kebam kekieege pecu nlumlu, nah penui rangdi, “Khrista kegwang dau, pa mina aipaude tei kegai swa kiee eh marengeidung pa tei lak ni?” <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mina maadibe Jisu ha aidungde rangpopbak la kedi Phariseemedung siulu, nah cingku kedimedung nah Phariseemedung kedimedung de pecu tuikera langgai. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ge Jisu rangdi, “Ih au nnuide ngngwa bam reu peting kedui nage ziemne, nah cipau cai Ih peda tetgai dizie acu lang kegaibe da. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nnui acu peei zie dede nnui acu ngau gailak, nah Ih daiga bam bi, nnui gwang gailak.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ciziemne Jewme reu kedimedung penui kakgade rangdi, “Daiga ge aipau pei de tetgai launo iciu eh anui pecu ngau gailak di kera? Pa au Greekme lungzangra kelamedung kakga mie eh Greekme de ledeu ladi lau memi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Pa rang kegai sam aide dai no, ‘Nnui acu peei zie dede acu ngaulu lak, nah Ih daiga bam bi, nnui gwang gailak’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Iciu eh hengyi tingba kedi kamtu benai, Jisu saplwe sahbak eh ranggai, “Keheibe de hereu lacai, peu pecu a da gwanglu nah a dade sak lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Acu nlum kelume,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Acu nlum kelume: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">acu Messiah lie de rang kelame nah nlum kelame kelikelu ngau kera ziemne.</char></note> kesanglaisiu ga rangkela nzwa, ‘Kereuki keringdui reu pe lung gade lwapet zie.’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Dede pa aide Rabe ha rang, nlum kelume ngaulu kera ha; Rabe de kaibeu mereu kedanemene Jisu de tei ndugai mereu kecune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:3">Isa. 44:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ge mina maadi kakgade midungge sam aidungde siu luge, rangdi, “Aipau de caihakecibe kesangbe delie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:11">Mat. 21:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Kedamedung rangdi, “Aide Khrista be delie.” Dede mikangge rangdi, “Kesangbe, Khrista au Galilee gade gwang lak, pa gwang zieni? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Kesanglaisiu ga Khrista David leuhme gade nah David lung kebam nam, Bethlehem gade gwang zielie kecu rang teu la meni?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic. 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Cine pe ziemne hemaabe ga mzi ge pangpop di. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Cine mi kangge pecu tuih luneu di, dede migede pe ba pe dage kaigai ma.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jewme muiteumedung nlumkemak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ge kedimedung cingku kedime nah Phariseeme da cailigwang, ge penui penui dage rangdi, “Daitei nnui pecu ngngwa gwang meno?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Kedimedung sam keli eh, “Migede madaude aipau pei de nzwa marang ma.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Cine Phariseemedung penui sam keli, “Nnui de de cwadi ni? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Kedime migede pecu nlum ma, mede Phariseemedung keheibe de, penui nlumlu di ni? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Dede hemaabe aide hezaibe ci kemakme, penui reset pung dida.” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nicodemus (Phariseeme ge pedwa peda kegwangbe hangge) penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Anui zai gade migede de pe ha siu railu kemakne nah pa daitei labi ci kemakne pe tutiak gailak meluini?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Penui sam keligai nah pe dage rangdi, “Nang de Galilee gade gwang meluini? Peei pielo nah caihakeci migede Galilee gade gwang kemak ngau luzie.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="ft" closed="false">laisiudung nda gu kesa John 7:53-8:11 de si. </char>
    </note> [Pecai mileune de pe kilung riep gwangkap di.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn 7:53-8:11</char>
    </note>Jisu Olivedung Deutu ga gwang di. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Pecai tingcang nuge pa kerecaki ga gwangdai, nah mina pelane gwanglu; pa ntumlu nah penui de ledeu. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Laisiukecime nah Phariseemedung mipui gede ngngwa gwang kemmha ta tei kebam tuilu eh. Penui pecu sum gage kailu. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Pecai penui pe dage rang, “Keledeubo, aipau puide mmha la eh tuilu dilie. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Cu hezaibe gade, mina ci kenzwame de tangtsu le samlo de Moses aja kaibeu; nang dai rangzie no pecu be?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev. 20:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Penui sam aide rang kebam penui hetak teipwa pecu mmaulu kerane tei, dede Jisu keukeimie kideu gade pe zurang le marau bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Penui pe dage ma keteu bam dige, pa cuhlu nah penui dage rang, “Nnui kak gade mige caube da kemau gahbi, peu pecu raitube tei eh pe dage tangtsu samgai lo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:1">Rom. 2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Pa ntum mie dailu, nah kideu gage pe zurang le marau bam daidi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Penui cide siu luge, kecingtube ne mdeulwe, penui hangge cai hangge tet kapdi. Kekamle Jisu katei di, sumga kebambe pui de ngngwa eh. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Jisu cuhlu nah pe dage rang, “Mipoi, ncu kemmau medung daiga bamno? Migede ncu mmau meda ni?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ge mipuibe rang eh, “Migede gah da, Rampaubo.” Jisu rang eh, “Ih de ncu mmau meda. Tetcu nah kemau teisi talo.”]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu teilung kesangkecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ge Jisu penui dage rangdai eh ranggai, “Ih kideu kebaabe delie; caugamme a caisuilu dibi pa kemui ga tetla lak dede kebaa keringbe ngaulu zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:46">Jhn. 12:46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Phariseemedung pe dage rang, “Nang nkatei n zierang tei lala; n zierang au kesang ma.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Jisu sam keligai nah penui dage rang, “Ih magade akatei azierang teila liede, a zierang au kesang. Kedanemene Ih daiga de gwangla bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih daiga de gwangla bi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daipai kengkieng gade Ih mata tei bambi Ih ci; Acu caune langgai bi Ih ci.</char></note> nah Ih daiga ge tetkai labi Ih cila, dede nnui au Ih daiga de gwang bi mede Ih daiga tetkai ziebi cima. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nnui au pumteihbe gade mide tiak lala; Ih au migede de tiak lama. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Magade Ih tiak liecai, iciuliede, Ih tiak kelade au kesang kedanemene Ih au akatei ma, dede Ih Peibe acu lang kegaibe da la. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mina hangna zierang au kesang kecu nnui zai gade cide rauteu la da. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Ih akatei a zierang tei kelabe, nah Peibe acu lang kegaibe a zierang teila.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Hez. 19:15</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ciziemne penui pe dage rang, “N pei daiga lano?” Jisu sam keligai, “Nnui acu de nah a Pei de de cima; magade nnui acu ci cai, nnui a Pei dede cilu zie nage.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Jisu kerecaki gade mide ledeu kecudau hema kehekwa kibung gade sam aidungde rang, nah migede pecu tui ma kedanemene pe bamdakkak gwang mereu kecune.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Cine pa rang dai penui dage, “Ih tetdi zie, nah nnui acu peei zie nah nnui mau gade tsaidi zie. Ih daiga gwangdi bi, nnui gwang gai lak.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ge Jewme rangdi, “Pa pekatei pecu teitset lak, pa teizie ni? Cine pa rangzeu ni, ‘Ih daiga gwangdi bi nnui gwang gai lak’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Cine Jisu penui dage rang, “Nnui au nkangle de gwang; Ih au nreule de gwang. Nnui au aipau kideube gu; Ih au aipau kideube gu au ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ciziemne, Ih nnui dage rangkecu nnui nnui mau gade tsai zie. Ih Delie kecu nnui nlumlu kemaktane, nnui nnui mau gade tsai zie.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Ciziemne penui pe dage rang, “Nang cau no?” Jisu penui dage rang, “Raitu gade Ih nnui dage rang kebam de delie. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ih nnui ha ma kekieege rang kera nah tiak kera bam. Iciuliede, acu lang kegaibe pa au kesangbe; nah Ih pe dade siu keludung, Ih aidungde kideube dage rangla.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Pa Peibe ha penui dage rangzeu lie kecu penui cilu tadi. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Cidau Jisu penui dage rang, “Nnui Mina Nabe de pwacu kecudau, cidau Ih de Ih lie kecu, nah Ih akatei a ziemne magede tei kemak nnui ci luzie. Dede Peibe acu ledeu kebeu siakte, Ih aidungde rangla. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Acu langkegaibe a da la, nah pa acu pütdi eh peu akatei dima, kedanemene Ih pa pesui kelabe tei mui lala.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Jisu aidungde rang kebam dau, mina kekieege pecu nlumlu.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham namedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Cidau Jisu Jewme pecu nlum kelumedung dage rang eh, “Nnui a samga bam lu liecai, nnui a caisuimedung kesangda; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />nah nnui kesangbe cilu zie, nah kesangbe ne nnui de lungmpet beuzie.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Penui pecu keli eh, “Anui Abraham leuhme nah madaude anui mi baang gede teima; nang dainzwa, ‘Nnuide lungmpet beuzie,’ de rang lulai?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, mileune de cauge kemau tei labi cipaume kemau baang teila. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Dede kilabe au kilung ga kelungta bam lamah; pe na be kelungta bamla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:30">Gal. 4:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ciziemne, Nabe nnuide lungmpet beudi cai, nnui au mpet kesang dizie. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nnui Abraham leuhme lie kecu Ih ci, dede nnui acu teitsetdi kera peei lala kedanemene a sam nnui da pebam gah. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ih a Pei de ngngwa eh dai ngau labi Ih rangla; ciziemne nnui de nnui peime dade dai siu lubi tei lala.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Penui pe sam keligai nah pe dage rang, “Anui pei au Abraham.” Jisu penui dage rang, “Magade nnui Abraham namedung cai, Abraham tei kela tadung nnui teizie. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Dede, cu au nnui acu teitset kera peei la dida, nnui dage Tinggwang dade siu kelu teu kesangbe ranglia kebeube de. Abraham au ainzwa tei ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nnui nnui peime batadung teila.” Ge penui pe dage, “Anui de hekakna tei eh mna luma; anui pei au ket: Cide Tinggwang.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herakesiabe namedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Jisu penui dage rang, “Magade Tinggwang nnui pei liecai, nnui acu hung luzie, kedanemene Ih Tinggwang dade gwang nah Ih aika bam; kedanemene Ih akatei a ziemne gwang bamma, dede pa ne langgai. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Daitei nnui a samdung cilu meno? Aide pekie nnui a samdung siulu kemakne. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nnui nnui peime dade kegwangbe, cide herakesiabe, nah nnui nnui pei suiyi tei neu lala. Pa au raitu gade mide teiketsetme nah pa kesangbe ga sapla ma kedanemene pe da kesangbe kette gah. Pa kenret kerang dau, pa pe luilung gade cide rang lala, kedanemene pa au kenretme ge nah pa kenret peibe da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:10">Bat. 13:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Dede, Ih kesangbe rang kegai ziemne, nnui acu nlum lamah. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nnui kakga cauge acu kemau ndam lu laino? Ih kesangbe rangcai, daitei nnui acu nlum mei no? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Caugamme Tinggwang dade gwangbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Caugamme Tinggwang dade gwangbi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang de ku, hing, nah rüt kelabe.</char></note> Tinggwang sam siulu la; aide ziemne nnui siulu meda, kedanemene nnui Tinggwang dade gwang kemakne.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pekatei pe zierang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ge Jewme reu kedime pesam keligai nah pe dage rang, “Anui kesangbe rang meni n da herakesiabe la nah nang Samariame lie kecu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Jisu sam keligai, “Ih a da herakesiabe gede gah, dede Ih a Pei de rütla, nah nnui acu rüt lamah. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Dede Ih a kendu de peei lamah; peei kela nah tiak kela mige bam. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, mikeheibe de a sam kai nzeu lucai, pa ketsai madau gede ngaulak lie.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Jewme pe dage rang eh, “Cu anui ciluda n da herakesia lalie kecu. Abraham nah caihakecimedung tsaidi da; dede nang rang eh, ‘Mikeheibe a sam kainzeu lucai, pa ketsai madau gede nsi lak.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Nang au anui pei Abraham tsai kedibe swade diki ma, nang dini? Caihakecimedung de tsai dida. Nang nkatei ncule caulie lano?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Jisu sam keligai, “Magade Ih akatei acu tei mdu lacai, a kendu au magede ma; a Pei ne acu teindu la, pa au nnui Tinggwang lie nnui rangla kecube de. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nnui pecu cilu ma, dede Ih pecu cila. Magade Ih rang cai, ‘Ih pecu cima de,’ Ih de nnui nzwa da, kenretme ge. Iciuliede, Ih pecu ci nah Ih pesamdung kai nzeu lala. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Nnui pau Abraham a tingba de ngau kera nlwa la, nah pa cide ngaulu nah pesui yilu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ciziemne Jewme pe dage rang eh, “Nang mmi riakngei de mereu, nah nang Abraham de ngau deni?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Jisu penui dage rang eh, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Abraham dwa de, Ih DE la dida.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ge penui tangtsu keucu pecu sam kera teidi, dede Jisu mbaidi nah kerecaki gwale mpetdi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Jisu kahgwang keladau, pa mipeige mnakelu gade miakciet kedige de ngau. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ge pe caisuimedung pecu keteu eh rangdi, “Keledeubo, cau mau no, mipei aide mi mede pe puipei no, iciu eh pa miakciet eh mna kecu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Jisu sam keligai, “Mipei aipaude dema mede pe peipui mau kedi ziemne ma, dede ciciu eh pe dade Tinggwang batadung de mide lialu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tingba kebam dauge anui acu lang kegaibe gu batadung tei maisia. Tingmui gwang di zeu da migede heta tei gailak dizie. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ih kideu ga kebam dau, Ih kideu gu kebaabe delie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jhn. 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Jisu aidungde rang kedi cai, pa pemcai nsui gai kideu gage nah ncai le tangdei henet lu, nah tangdei cide pecu pwa keniak gai, pe miak gage. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Pecai pa pe dage rang, “Tetcu lo, Siloam rejai gade hui lulo,” (“Langgai” kecu gage rang nzeu). Cine mipei be tetdi, nah huilu, nah mangau eh caili gwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa. 35:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ge pe kidamedung nah pedwa pecu hatyei la eh ngau kelamedung rang eh, “Mina aipau de ntum delwe hatyei bam kela de meni?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Midungge rang eh, “Aide pa da.” Kedame rang eh, “Melie, pa kenzwa kauge lie.” Dede pa rang eh cu, “Ih au pa da.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ge penui pecu keteugai, “Dainzwa nmiak ngkei lu di no?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ge pa sam keligai, “Mige Jisu lie kecu kauge ne tangdei teilu nah a miak gage keniakgai nah a dage rang, ‘Siloam ga miecu nah hui lulo.’ Cine Ih mie nah huilu, nah Ih mangau dailu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Penui pe dage rang, “Pa daiga bam no?” Pa sam keli pwa, “Ih au ci meda.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phariseeme teingkei kebeude kegakecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Penui miakciet kelabe pei de ngngwa Phariseemedung da gwang. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Cu cide au Sabbath tingba benai Jisu tangdei teilu nah pe miak ngkeibeu kecudau. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ge Phariseemedung de dai nzwa pa mangau dailu dibi pecu keteu dai. Pa penui dage rang, “Pa a miak gage tangdei kaigai, nah Ih cide huilu, nah cu Ih mangau lu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ge Phariseeme mikangge rang eh, “Mina aide Tinggwang dade gwang ma, kedanemene pa Sabbath mnei meda.” Kedamedung rang eh, “Dainzwa mi kemau mege marehi cinkezwa teilu lai?” Iciu eh penui kak gade mzi pangdi. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Cine penui miakcietbe pei dade keteu dai eh, “Nang pecu le cau lie lano, pa mmiak ngkei beu kecune?” Miakcietbe rangdi, “Pa au caihakecime ge.” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Cu kecangde Jewme reu kedime pe hade nlum ma pa pe miakciet lie kecu nah pa mangau daikelu, penui mangaudai kelube pe pui pe pei de quteugwang kemakta. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Penui puipei dade keteu, rang eh, “Aide nnai na deni, pa au pemiakciet eh mnalu dilie nnai rang kelabe de? Dainzwa pa cu mangaulu dino?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Cine pe puipei sam keligai nah rangdi, “Anai cilie aide au anai na nah pa pe miakciet eh mnalu kecu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Dede pa dainzwa cu mangau lu dibi, anai ci ma, nah caune pemiak ngkei beu bi, anai ci ma. Pe dade keteu lulo, pa ngkieng kedime ge dida. Pa pekatei pe ziemne ranglu buida.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Pe puipei aidungde rangdi, kedanemene penai Jewmedung de hing kedine. Kedanemene Jewmedung kesuizwa lwe mina keheibe de pecu Khristabe delie kerangbe de synagogue gade gwadi zielie bam kedine. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Aide ziemne, pe puipei rangdi, “Pa kengkiengme dida, pe dade keteu lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Cine pekenabe de penui miakcietbe pei de qu nah pe dage rangdi, “Tinggwang de hetwa peulo. Anui cilie mina aide kemaume ge lie kecu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ge cipau pei de keligai, “Pa au kemaume mi mebi Ih au ci melie. Ma ket Ih ci lie; Ih a miakciet kecu, nah cu Ih mangau luda.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ge penui pe dage rang, “Pa ncu daige tei no? Pa dainzwa mmiak ngkei beu no?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Pa penui sam keligai, “Ih nnui dage ranglia beu dida, nah nnui kingneilu ma! Daitei nnui siu dai neu lareu no? Nnui pe caisuime teilu neu la ni, nnui tei eh ni?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ge penui pecu kesiu eh, “Nang au pe caisuime ge, dede anui au Moses caisuimedung. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Anui ci lie Tinggwang Moses de mpau kecu, dede mi aide dai gade gwang bi kecu anui au cima.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Mipeibe sam keligai nah penui dage rang, “Cu aide au miswa kegah ta ge, pa dai gade gwang bi kecu nnui ci kemak, dede pa a miak ngkeibeu. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tinggwang kemaume kwa kingnei la kemak cide anui ci, dede magade mige pecu reca nah pe lungning tei cai, pa pecu kingnei la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:29">Mac. 15:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kideube mdeu kelu gade madaude siu ma mina keheibede pe miakciet eh mna kelume miak ngkeikelu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Magade mina aide Tinggwang dade gwang mecai, pa magede tei gailak.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Penui keli gai nah pe dage rang eh, “Ncu au mau cangsiak cu gage mna lu, nah nang anui de ledeu lani?” Iciu eh penui pecu kelien mpetdi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rabe lam miakciet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Penui pecu synagogue gade gwa kedi Jisu cide siu lu. Ge Jisu pecu ngaulu nah rang eh, “Nang Mina Nabe de nlum lani?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Pa sam keli nah rang eh, “Nah pa cau no, Rampaubo, iciu eh Ih pecu nlumlu kerane?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Jisu pe dage rang, “Nang pecu ngau da kesang, nah pa ncu ngngwa mpau kebambe deda.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ge minabe rang eh, “Rampaubo, Ih nlum lie” nah pa pecu reca di. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Jisu rang eh, “Tutiak tei kera ziemne Ih kideu aide ga gwang iciu eh ngau mene kelame ngaulu kerane nah ngau kebamme miakcietdi kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Phariseeme pecu ngngwa kelame kangge aidungde siulu ge pe dade keteu, “Anui au miakciet ma, anui ciet ni?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Jisu penui dage rang eh, “Nnui miakciet liecai, nnui kemau bamlak nage, dede cu nnui rang eh, ‘Anui mangau bam,’ cine nnui mau bamreu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Meurünkekwabe nah pe meurünhau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, meurünki ga kirieki gade lüt mene keda lampui gade nrakah kelabe au keregame nah sütketyeime delie. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Dede cau kirieki gade lüt labi cipaube au meurün kekwabe delie. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Kirieki kekwabe pe ziemne ngkei beula. Meuründung pe kwa siu lula, nah pa pe meuründung zi riep qula nah penuide nzang mpet beula. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Pa pe meurün hau peciakne de ngngwa mpet luge, pa penui dwa rai mie, nah meuründung pe caisui la, kedanemene penui pe kwa cila. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Dede penui cikemakme cai sui dilak, dede pe dade penui pak mdei di zie, kedanemene penui cikemakme kwa ci lamah.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Jisu samgwa aide penui dage rang, dede penui cilu tadi cide dai bi kecu pa penui dage rang kebam de.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ge Jisu penui dage rang dai eh, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Ih au meurün kirieki be da. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />A dwa gwang kecu leune keregame nah sütketyeime da, dede meuründung penui kwa kingnei ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ih au heriekibe lie. Keheibe de a dade lütlu cai, pecu kelilu zie, nah pa nlütlu zie nah mpet eh ceheideu ngau luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:20">Lei. 118:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Keregabe rega kera nah teitset kera nah ngkap kera ziemne gwale gwang lamah. Ih gwang kebam au penui kering ngaulu kerane nah peu ngaukieelu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ih au meurün kekwa keyibe. Meurün kekwa keyibe meurün ziemne pe teilung kaibeu la. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Dede pezie liteu kela kilabe au meurün kekwabe ma nah meuründung de pegu ma. Pa heneu kegwang ngaulu ge meuründung de gihdi eh pak dila, nah heneu de penuide tui nah penuide gwa zangradi. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Pa pak tetdila kedanemene pa au pezie liteu kela kilabe kecune nah pa meuründung de lungpang lamah. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Ih au meurün kekwa keyibe, nah Ih agu cila, nah agu acu cila. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Cinzwa, Peibe acu cila, nah Ih Peibe de ci, nah Ih meuründung ziemne a teilung kaibeu la. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ih meurün kedabedung de bamreu aipau meurün ki ga bam kemakbe. Ih penui de de ngngwa gwang maisia, nah penui a kwa siu luzie, iciu eh meurün hau ket nah meurün kekwabe de ket lu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Aide ziemne Peibe acu hung la: Ih a teilung kaibeu iciu eh Ih cide ludai lu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Migede a dade cide keuteu di gailak, dede Ih akatei cide kaibeu di zeu. Ih cide kaibeu kera kengkieng a da bam, nah Ih cide keuteu dai kera de kengkieng a da bam. Ih aja aide a Pei dade ngau luda.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Sam aidung de ziemne Jewme kak gade pangpop dai di. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Kedanemene mi kekieege rangdi, “Pa herakesia de ngngwa la dida nah mie dida. Daitei nnui pecu kingnei lano?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Mikedame rangdi, “Sam aidung de au herakesia ngngwa kelame sam ma. Herakesiabe au miakcietme miak tei mrak gailak, pa teilu buini?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jewme nlumkemakme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Cidau Jerusalem ga Teikemci Hengyi ting di. Cide tingtiak ting, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />nah Jisu tet nlüt mpet bam kerecaki ga Solomon kigu ga. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Cidau Jewme pecu twagwalu eh pe dage rangdi, “Dai tiege nang anui de peu ci mcilu mene bam zie no? Nang Khrista de liecai, anui de ndulia lo.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Jisu penuide keligai, “Ih nnui dage ranglia da, dede nnui nlum ma. Ih a Pei zi gade batadung tei keladung, aide a zierang delie. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Dede nnui nlumlu ma, kedanemene nnui a meurün kemak ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />A meuründung a kwa siu lula; Ih penui de ci, nah penui a caisui la. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ih penui de kelungta kering pwapeu, nah penui madau de tsai lak, nah mige ne de penui keheibe de a ba gade sütteu di gailak. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />A Pei, penuide acu pwa kepeube, ma keda pelane swade diki, nah penuide migede Peibe ba gade sütteu di gailak. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ih nah Peibe au ket.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Cidau Jewmedung tangtsudung keucuh dai eh pecu sam zielie di. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Jisu penuide sam keligai, “Ih nnui dage bata keyi kekiee Peibe dade keulia da. Bata cidung gade daide ziemne nnui acu sam zielie zeuno?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Jewme pe sam keligai, “Bata keyi ge ziemne anui ncu sam zielie bam ma, dede Tinggwang de rangmsia kela ziemne, nah kedanemene nang, mina, nkatei ncu Tinggwang lie kelane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev. 24:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Jisu penui sam keligai, “Nnui zai gage rau nzeu meluini, ‘Ih ranggai, “Nnui au rabedung”’?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Lei. 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Magade Tinggwang sam penui dage kegwangme de pa rabedung lie qu lacai (kesanglaisiu au gikah di gailak), <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Peibe ne keuntsam kedibe nah kideu gage langkegaibe dage, ‘Nang au Tinggwang de rangmsia la dida,’ de eh nnui rangla ni, kedanemene Ih ranggai, ‘Ih au Tinggwang Nabe lie’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ih magade a Pei ta tei melie cai, acu nlum so. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Dede magade Ih cidungde tei bam liecai, nnui acu nlum melie de, batadung nlumlu lo iciu de Peibe a da la lie kecu nah Ih Peibe da la lie kecu nnui ci lubui nah cisiakte luzie.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ciziemne penui pecu nim kera tei dai, dede pa penui deu gwale ge tetgai di.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Cine pa Jordan reu gwale ge tetgai daidi John keraidau mide duipum ketei bam gage, nah pa cika bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Mina kekiee ge Jisu da gwang nah penui rangdi, “John au marehi gede tei ma kesang, dede John aipau pei de ha rang kegai ma pelane kesangda.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ge mina kekiee cika de pecu nlumlu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lazarus tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Mipei ge pezi Lazarus lie kecu de mra bam. Pa au Bethany nam gade, Mary nah pe sinapui Martha nam gade. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mary aipau dene maca le Rampaube de keniak nah pe tam le pe pi neu, pe heipei Lazarus mra bam. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Pe tipui kena Jisu dage sam langgai, eh ranggai, “Pielo, Rampaubo, nang hungkelabe pa mra bamlie.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Dede Jisu sam cide siu luge, pa rangdi, “Mateei aide ketsai mateei ma, dede cide au Tinggwang zi peu ndulu kerane iciu eh Tinggwang Nabe depeu cide gade ndulu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Cu Jisu Martha nah pe sinapui nah Lazarus de hungdi. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Cine pa Lazarus mra bam lie kecu siulu ge, Jisu tetmene bamdi langnane bamsi pa kebam ni ga. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ge pecai, pa caisuimedung dade rangdi, “Anui Judea ga nligwangdai cugo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Caisuimedung pe dade rangdi, “Keledeubo, Jewme cune tangtsu pwa ncu sam kera tei bam, nah nang cika nli gwang daizie reuni?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Jisu sam keligai, “langnaige ga bamdakkak kereiekena bam meni? Mige ting kebaadau tet lacai, pa pepi nsui lama, kedanemene pa ngaula aipau kideu kebaa dene. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ciuliede, mige tingmui tet lacai, pa pepi nsui zie kedanemene peda kebaa gah kecune”. <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Pa ma aidung de ranggai, nah aipau dungde cai, pa penui dage rangdi, “Anui zangbe Lazarus zip dida, dede Ih au tet zie da iciu eh zip kebam gade Ih pecu ngkialu kerane”. <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Caisuimedung ciziemne pe dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, pa zip zeu cai, pa yidai luzie.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Cu Jisu au pa tsai kedi ha rang, dede penui Pa au ziep mtak zeulie kecu ha rang bamlie cetti. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ciziemne Jisu penui dage ranglia mci siakte beu, “Lazarus tsai dida. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nnui ziemne, Ih cika bam kemakpe a suiyi, iciu eh nnuide peu acu nlumlu kerane. Dede anui peda mie go.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ge Thomas, Didymus lie de qu kelabe, caisuime pe zangme dage rang, “Anui liede mie go iciu eh anui Jisu de ngngwa tsai kerane.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Lazarus tipui kena lung taukemla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ciziemne, Jisu gwang kecudau, Lazarus herau ga lang mdai ne bam di kecu pa ngaulu. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Cu Bethany au Jerusalem kemna ga, stadia kereimengei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Stadia kereimengei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide kilometer kecum mede mile kena kenzwa dei ge.</char></note> kenzwa dei ge. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Jewme kekieege Martha nah Mary da gwang, penai heipei ziemne penai lung tei nciep beu kera. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ge Martha, Jisu gwang zeulie kecu pa siu keludau, tet mie pecu redau, dede Mary au kilung ga bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Ge Martha Jisu dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang aika bam liecai, a heipei tsaidi lak nage. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Dede cude, nang Tinggwang dade makeheibede kie gaide, pa ncu pwapeu kera Ih cibam.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “N heipei ringcuh dai luzie.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Martha pe dage rangdi, “kamtube nai pa ringcuh dai lu kera Ih cibam.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:15">Bat. 24:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih ringcuhdai kelube nah keringriabe da; acu nlum kelame au, pa tsaidi de, ringdai luzie; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />nah caugame ring eh bam nah acu nlum kelume madau gede tsai dilak. Nang aide nlum demi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Pa pe dage rangdi, “Yeo, Rampaubo, Ih nlum nang au Khrista lie, Tinggwang Nabe, kideu ga lunggwang lai eh kelabe lie.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Pa aide rang kelu cai, pa tetdi nah ngkim eh pe sinapui Mary de qulu. Pa rangdi, “Keledeube aika gwang bam nah ncu quzeu lie.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Pa aide siulu ge, pa cuh zette lu nah pe da miedi. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Cidau Jisu renam ga gwang mereu, dede Martha pecu keredau kecu ni ga cude bam reu. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Cine Jewmedung cidau, kilung ga pecu ngngwa kebamme nah pe lung taumla kebamme, Mary cuh zettelu nah mpet kedi ngau luge, pa herau ga mie cikade hap lau ha kecu mning eh penui pe caisui mie. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Iciu eh Mary Jisu kebam ni ga gwang canglu nah pecu ngaulu ge, pe pi ga keumie pa nah pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang aika bam liecai, a heipei tsaidi lak nage.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ciziemne Jisu pa kehap, nah pecu ngngwa gwang kela Jewmedung de kehap ngaulu ge, pa pelung sia sütdi nah pelung kehereidi; <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />cine pa rangdi “Nnui pecu dai gage kaipwa bam no?” Penui pe dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, gwang eh pielo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Jisu hapdi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ge Jewmedung rangdi, “Pielo pa Lazarus de daikenzwa gede hungbi!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Dede mi kangge rangdi, “Mina aipaude teilubui meni, miakcietme ge miak tei hemi kelube, mina aipau dede peu tsai melu kera?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Lazarus de ketsai gade teucuh kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Ge Jisu pelung sia süt dai eh herau ga mie. Cu cide tsupop ge, nah cide tangtsu gele nket pwabam. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jisu rangdi, “Tangtsu de kwak keziadi.” Martha, tsai kedibe tipui, Jisu dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, pe paau tim nnamdi zieda, kedanemene lang mdaine dide lu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih n dage rang meni, nang nlumlu cai, Tinggwang kendu nang ngau luzie de kecu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Cine penui tangtsu pwagi di. Pecai Jisu ngang cuh pie nah rangdi, “Apei, Ih ncu twa la nang a kwa kingnei kebeune. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ih nang a kwa kingnei bam mui kela Ih ci, dede mina maabe acu twagwapung kesapme ziemne, Ih sam aide rang gai, iciude nang ne acu langgai beulie kecu peu penuide nlumlu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Pa aide rangkelu cai, pa marang sahbak gai, “Lazarus, mpet lulo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de teitset kera ciem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Tsai kedibe de mpet lu; pe pi nah pe ba pai le kezuipung eh, nah pe zu pai ge le kezuipung eh. Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Pecu hiakgai nah pecu peu tetcuh.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ge Jewme kekiee ge Mary da kegwangme Jisu tei kegai de ngaulu delwe pecu nlum lu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Dede penui kangge Phariseemedung da mie nah Jisu matei kegaidung penui dage rangbeu.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Cine cingku kedime nah Phariseeme baudi ncüt eh qu hekwalu eh rangdi, “Anui daipai tei lai? Mina aipaude ma miswakegah bata kekieege teila. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Anui pecu aiciu eh püt dizie liecai, peciakne pecu nlum luzie, nah Romme gwangzie nah anui dade sütteu dizie anui nam de nah anui leuh de.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Iciuliede, penui kedime kakde Caiaphas lie kecu mige, cipau kumde cingku kedibe teikebambe penui dade rangdi, “Nnui magede cima. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Mina hangge mina pelane ziemne tsai kecu be yiki lie de kecu nnui cet gaila meni, nah ciude heleuh pelane ngkapdi kelak.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Cu pa sam aide kerang au pekatei pedade rang petma. Meliene, cipau kumde cingku kedibe tei kebam nzwa, Jisu heleube ziemne tsaibeu zielie kecu pa cairasam ranggai; <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />nah heleube ziemne rünne ma, dede iciu eh Tinggwang namedung zangra kela leune de de hekwa ncüt teu gwang peu ket teilu kerane lie. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Cine cipau nai gade penui Jisu de dainzwa teitset zie bi kecu riem cudi.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ciziemne Jisu Jewme kakga mdu eh tetpet ham tadi, dede pa cikade tetpwa hetaideu taiga deudi kebam Ephraim lie qu kecu nam ga miedi. Pa caisuimedung de ngngwa cika bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Cu Jewme gu Kahkegwang ngyi mna di, nah mi kekieege deudi gade Kahkegwang ngyi dwa penui katei de tei mcilu zielie eh Jerusalem ga hangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:17">2 Hel. 30:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Cine penui Jisu de peidi, nah hangge ge de ngngwa resiu penui kerecaki ga sap keludau, “Nnui kecet dai no? Pa hengyi ga gwang lakmi de kecu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Cu Cingku kedimedung nah Phariseemedung aja peu gai eh mi keheibe de Jisu daiga bam bi cilu cai, pa paulia maisia iciu de penui pecu nimlu kerane.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de Bethany gade keniakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ciziemne, kahkegwang ngyi dwa lang herokne benai, Jisu Bethany ga gwanglu, Jisu ketsai gade kwak mring cu kelu Lazarus kebam nam ga. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Cine penui pecu tingmui taktyei mteibeu, nah Martha ne ma rengei bam, dede Lazarus au Jisu de ngngwa taktyeibam ga kebam mi hangge. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Pecai Mary maca perim kehengui litra ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Litra ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">litre pempie kenzwa ge.</char></note> pemi hungsüt kecu nard le tei kelube keugwang, cide lepwa Jisu pi keniaklu, delwe pe tamle pe pi neu. Ge maca perim kehengui le kilung puidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Dede Judas Iscariot, pa ledeukelu hangge, pecu tuigai beu kerabe rangdi, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Daitei eh marim kehengui ca aide denarii haicum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarii haicum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pe zie tei eh heta keteime ge gu mmi ge zie kenzwa kiee ge.</char></note> gade zwa pwa kegahme de peudi meno?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Cidau pa cide rang kegai, pa kegahme de ku kebamne ma, dede pa keregame ge kecune. Pe da rangkangbung de la nah cika kai kebeude gade pa regalu kera ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ciziemne Jisu rangdi “Pecu pütdi lu. Pa au acu kekung benai ziemne aide kai kenzeu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Kedanemene kegahme au nnuide ngngwa bam muizie. Dede nnui au acu ngngwa bam muilak lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:7">Mrk. 14:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Ge Jewme mi kekiee ge Jisu cika bamlie kecu cilu, nah penui gwang, Jisu ziemne rünne ma, dede Lazarus de de pie kera ziemne, ketsai gade Jisu ne kwak nring kecube de. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Dede cingku kedimedung gwang ncütlwe Lazarus de de teitsetdi zielie eh riem cuhdi; <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kedanemene pe ziemne Jewme kekiee ge tetdi nah Jisu de nlum kedine.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hecili eh kelüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Cipau cia benai mina maadi ge hengyi ga gwang. Jisu Jerusalem ga gwang zeulie kecu penui siulu ge, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />penui laira bang kiakdung keulu nah pecu redau zielie tet pet delwe sahbak eh “Hosanna! Rampaube zi teu kegwangbe samlam pungtu lie, Israelme gwangpei,” dedi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Lei. 118:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Dede Jisu gadana ge ngaulu eh pereu ga bamlu; kesanglaisiu ga rauteu kelanzwa, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Ngngi helo, Zion napui; pielo, n gwangpei gwang zeulie, gada nage reu ga bam eh.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:9">Isa. 40:9</ref>, <ref loc="ZEP 3:1">Zep. 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Pa ledeukelumedung keraidau aidungde cilu tadi; dede Jisu de kendu ga teucuh luge, pe ha aidungde raupwa kebam nsunglu delwe penui ma aidungde pe dage tei kegai nsunglu. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Cidau mina maabe cu pa Lazarus de herau gade qu mpetlu nah ketsai gade kwak mring keludau penuide pecu ngngwa la delie de eh pe zierang teigai. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Aipau kie de ziemne de mina maabe pecu redau kerane mie pet, kedanemene pa marehi aide tei kegai penuide siu kecu ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Phariseemedung ciziemne penui kak gade rangdi, “Ainie, nnui magede teilu bam meda; pielo, kideube pecai suila dida.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pe tsit ha mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Cidau reca zielie eh hengyi ga kehangme kakga Greekme kangge dela. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ciziemne mina aipaudungde Galilee deu ga kebam Bethsaidame Philip da gwang pecu keteu eh, “Kedibo, anui Jisu de ngauneu lalie,” dedi. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Philip mie Andrew dage rangbeu; Andrew Philip de nzang mie, delwe penai Jisu dage rangbeu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Dede Jisu penaide keligai eh penai dade rangdi, “Mina Nabe de tei ndu kera bamdakkak be gwang dida. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, ciu pumge kideu ga cakmie nah tsaigai mecai, pekatei bamla; dede cide tsaigai cai, cide petsi buisüt lubui. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mi keheibe de pe teilung ku kelame cide tei nggah dizie; dede mi keheibe de kideu aika pe teilung ku kemakme kelungta kering gage kailu zie. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Keheibede a gwa teicai, pecu peu acai suilu; nah Ih daiga bambi, cika a gwa keteime de bam luzie. Keheibe de a gwa teicai, Peibe pecu herüt peuzie. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Cu au Ih a lung keherei dida nah Ih daipai ranglai? ‘A pei, bamdakkak aika de acu kelibeu lo’? Dede Ih aipau kie de ziemne Ih bamdakkak aika gwang delu. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />A pei, n zi de peu hetwa punglu.” Ge tinggim gade makwa ge gwang eh rangdi, “Cide Ih tei ndu dida nah Ih cide tei ndu dai beuzie.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ge cika kesap maabe cide siu keludau tingceu zeuda de eh rangdi. Mi kedame, “Tinggimgwame ge pecu mpau da,” dedi. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Jisu keligai nah rangdi, “Makwa aide a ziemne ma, dede nnui ziemne gwang lei. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Cu au kideu aide tutiak zieda: Cu au kideu aika kengkieng keteube de<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kideu aika kengkieng keteube de: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satan, mede herakesiabe de rangbam, pecu kideu aide rabe de de eh qula.</char></note> kelien gidi zieda. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Kideu aika de acu teucuh keludau, mina pelane de ada teugwang dizie.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Dede pa daipai tsit tsai ziebi de kecu ranglia kera ziemne pa sam aide ranglie. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ge mina maabe pecu keligai, “Anui hezaibe gade Khrista kelungta bamzie de eh siu da. Nang dainzwa eh, ‘Mina Nabe de teu ncuhlu maisia’? de eh rang zeuno? Mina Nabe aide cauno?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan. 7:14</ref></char></note>” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ge Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Kebaa de tingkakke swa nnuide ngngwa bamsi lakta. Kebaa nnui da kebamdau ge tet lulo, iciu eh kemuibe de peu nnui dwa rai di melu kerane. Cau kemui ga tet la bi pa daiga tet gailai eh zeubi ci lamah. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Nnui da kebaa kebam dauge, kebaabe de nlum lulo iciu eh nnui kebaa be name teilu kera ziemne”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jisu ma aidungde ranggai nah cipaucai tet lamna di nah penui dade mbai di.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jewme nlumkemak ga la kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Jisu penui dwagade marehi kekiee ge teigai lie de, penui pecu nlumlu tadi <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />iciu eh Isaiah caihakecibe sam kerang de tei canglu kerane, pa kerang de:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Rampaubo, caudung anui pwalia kegai de nlum no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">nah Rampaube pe ba pwa caudung de liano?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Aipau kie de ziemne penui nlum gailak di, kedanemene Isaiah de rangsi gai,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Pa penui miak tei cietdi, nah penui nlung tei tak dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">meliecai penui miakle ngau nah penui nlungbe le cilu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">nah nreu gwang lu kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">nah Ih penuide teingkeibeu lu kera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa. 6:10</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaiah ma aidungde rangdi kedanemene pa Jisu kendu ngau nah pe ha ranggai kecune. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Dede cinzwa liede, Jewme reu kedime kekiee ge Jisu de nlumlu; dede Phariseeme ziemne, penui rangmeidi iciu eh synagogue gade peu penui puikam teidi melu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kedanemene Tinggwang ne ketwa swade mina twabe penui suiyi ki kedi ziemne.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Pecai Jisu marang sahbak eh rangdi, “Acu nlum kelame, acu rünne nlum ma dede acu langkegaibe de de nlum la, <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />nah acu ngau kelume acu langkegaibe de de ngau luda. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mina keheibede acu nlum kelume depeu kemui ga bam tadi kera ziemne Ih kebaabe tei eh kideu aika gwanglie. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mina keheibede a samdung siulu delwe nlumlu mecai, Ih pecu tiak lak; kedanemene Ih kideube de tiak zielie eh gwang ma, dede kideube de kelilu zielie eh gwang. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Acu mlai kecume nah a samdung mzaila kemakme, pecu tiak kerame ge bam. Ih rang kegai samde ne kamtu benai pecu tiak zie. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kedanemene Ih akatei marang petmah, dede A pei acu langkegaibe Ih daipai rang maisia bi nah Ih daipai rangzie bi de kecu pa ne pe sam kaibeu. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Pe sam kai kebeu cide au kelungta kering samlie kecu Ih cibam, cine cide Ih rangla, Peibe ne a dage rang kebeude nzwa, Ih de rang lalei.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Jisu ledeukelume pi huikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Iciu eh Kahkegwang Ngyi dwa, Jisu kideu aika de tetpwa Peibe da gwang di kera pe bamdakkak gwang kedi cilu. Pa kideu ga kebam dau pegumedung de hung eh gwang, nah pa penuide penli kecang de hung gwanglu. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Iciu eh tinghegi matyei kebam dau, herakesiabe Jisu de tui gaibeu kera Simon napei Judas Iscariot nlung gage kaibeu beudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Nah pa Peibe ne ma pekiene pwa pe ba gage kaibeu kedi nah pa Tinggwang dade gwang delwe Tinggwang da nligwang daidi kera cilu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Matyei kebam gade pa cuhlwe pai hegwa de gaudi. Ge pa baneupai keulu delwe pekia kanglu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Pa pecai dui ruipwa hekwak ge gage kailu eh ledeukelume pi hui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ledeukelume pi hui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide penui hezai tei pwabam kilame hegiame pi hui kela.</char></note> cuhdi, delwe pa pe kia kang teukela pai dele neu cangdi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Pecai jüja pa Simon Peter da gwang ge Peter pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang a pi hui launi?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Jisu pe sam keligai eh pe dage rangdi, “Ih tei kebam aide nang cu ci lakreu, dede pecaine nang aide ci luzie.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Peter pe dage rangdi, “Ncu peu madau gede a pi huilak.” Jisu pecu keligai, “Ih ncu hui mecai, nang ada de nqwa magede gah.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simon Peter pe dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, a pi rünne meliene, aba de nah a peu de silo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Jisu pe dade rangdi “Duipia kedime madu mede, pepi gwale huisi mede yida, dede pa au mci cang dida; nah nang au mci dida, dede mina pelane ma.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Kedanemene Jisu caune pecu tui gai zie bi ci kebamne, cine pa rangdi, “Nnui pelane mci ma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Iciu eh Jisu penui pi huilu ge pe pai keu balu eh ntum mie bam daidi, pa penui dade rang eh, “Nnui Ih nnui ziemne tei kegai de cilu demi?. <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Nnui acu ‘Keledeubo’ nah ‘Rampaubo’ de eh qula, cide nnui rang siakte lada, Ih au aide delu. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Iciu eh Ih nnui Rampaube nah keledeube eh, nnui pi huilu lie cai, nnuide hangge ge pi hui kerabe nsam lie. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Kedanemene Ih nnuide puisau tei lia beu dida iciu eh Ih nnui ziemne tei kegai nzwa nnuide teilu maisia. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, kilabe au pe mpaube swa dimah, mede langkegaime pecu lang kegaibe swade dimah. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Magade nnui ma aidungde cilu eh cidungde teila liecai nnui samlam pungtu delie.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu pecu tuigai kera mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Ih nnui pelane ha rang bam ma, Ih kedet kelume de Ih ci bam, dede iciu eh kesanglaisiu de tei canglu kerane ziemne; ‘Acu ngngwa tangku ketyeibe pe pi hwapwa acu caidi.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lei. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ma cide tei gwang di kemak dwa Ih nnui dage nrai aide cu ranggai la iciu eh cide kegwang dau, nnui Ih lie kecu nlumlu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:29">Jhn. 14:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, Ih langkegai keheibe de ngngwa kelume, acu ngngwa lula, nah acu ngngwa kelume, acu langkegaibe de de ngngwa lula.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Jisu aide rang kecu dau, pa rabe gade pelung keherei sütdi. Pa zierang tei nah rangdi, “Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, nnui hangge ne acu tuigai beuzie.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Ledeukelumedung hangge ge de kerepie bam di, pa caube de rang zeubi penui swa ga bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Dede pa ne ledeukelume hange, Jisu pecu hung kelabe, Jisu mbie ga taktyeibam ga ngngei bam. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Ciziemne Simon Peter maciem tei gai ledeukelube aide dage, “Pa caube ha cide rang bam bi pecu keteu gailo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Cine pa nreu dai gwang Jisu mbie ga ngngeilu delwe pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, cide cauno?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Jisu keligai, “Ih tangku mpunglu eh pecu pwa kepeube de da.” Iciu eh pa tangku cide mpunglu eh keupwa Simon Iscariot napei Judas depeu. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ge pa tangku tyei kelu cai, Satan pe lung ga lütdi, ciziemne Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Nang tei kerabe cide tei zette lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Taktyei bamga ngngei kebamme pa dai tei aide pecu rangbi cu migede cima. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kedanemene kangge cet kecu, Judas au rangkangbung keteube kecune, Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Hengyi de ziemne anui teu maikesia lui kerane,” mede pa kegahme de mage peu maisia kecune. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Pecai Judas tangku keulu siakke, pa hegwale zette mpetdi. Cidau tingmui di.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Peter pecu mlaidi kera mraikerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ciziemne, Judas tetdi ge, Jisu rang eh, “Cu au Mina Nabe kendu keulia zeu da, nah pedade Tinggwang kendu keulia zeu da. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Tinggwang pe dade pecu tei ndu luzie, nah pa pecu tei ndu zette luzie. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Henamedung, Ih tingkakge swa nnuide ngngwa bam si lakta. Nnui acu peei zie, nah Ih Jewme dage rang kebeu nzwa, ‘Nnui Ih kegwang ga gwang gailak.’ Ih cu nnui dage aide rangla. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ih nnui hangge ge de hung lulo eh samkak keheci ge peula; Ih nnuide hungkela nzwa, cine nnuide hangge ge hunglu maisia. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Nnui hangge ge de hung lucai, aide gade mina pelane nnui a caisuime lie kecu cilu zie.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon Peter pe dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang daiga miedi lai zeuno?” Jisu pecu keligai, “Ih kemie ga, cu nang a caisui mie gailak, dede cipau cai nang a caisui luzie.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Peter pe dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, daitei Ih cu n caisui gailak no? Ih n ziemne a teilung de kaibeu zie.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Jisu keligai, “Nang a ziemne n teilung kaibeu zie lieni? Ih n dage rangsiakte liazie, nang acu piacum mlai kemak dwa nrui kwalak zing.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Jisu kedetkelume lung taukemla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Nnui lung keherei diso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nnui lung keherei diso: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ledeukelumedung penui lung pang sütdi Jisu penuide gidi kera ha de rang kegai ne.</char></note> Nnui Tinggwang de nlumlu, acu de nlum bamlu. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Apei ki ga kibungdung kekiee ge bam. Dede Iciu melie cai au, Ih nnui dage ranggai beu dizie nage, Kedanemene Ih au nnui ziemne heni ge mtei beulai eh bam. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ih mie eh nnui ziemne heni ge mtei lude, Ih cailigwang daizie nah akatei nnuide ngngwa luzie, iciu eh nnuide Ih kebam ga bam luzie. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Ih daiga tetgai ziebi nnui lampuibe cibam.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Thomas Jisu dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang daiga tetgai ziebi anui ci ma, anui dainzwa eh lampuibe cilu laino?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih au lampuibe, nah kesangbe, nah keringbe; a dade kemak cai migede Peibe da gwang gailak. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Nnui acu ci lie cai, a Pei de de cilu zie nage. Cu gade nnui pecu cilu nah pecu ngaude luda.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Philip Jisu dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, peibe de pwa anuide lialo; nah iciu cai anui ziemne nnung cang dizie.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Jisu pe dade rangdi, “Philip, Ih peting ketie ge nnuide ngngwa bamde nang acu ci mereu lieni? Mina keheibe de acu kengaume Peibe dede ngau dida. Nang dainzwa eh, ‘Anuide Peibe de pwalia lo, de rang lano’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ih au Peibe lung ga bam nah Peibe a lung ga bamkecu nang nlumla meni? Ih nnui dage sam rang keladung de akatei adade rang melie, dede Peibe a lung ga kebam ne pekatei pe ta teibam. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Acu nlum lulo Ih au Peibe lung ga, nah Peibe a lung ga kebam de, meliecai batadung tei kela ziemne nlum lulo. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, mina keheibede de acu nlum kelume, Ih tei keladung, pa de teizie; nah pa cidung swade diki kecu tadung teizie; kedanemene Ih au Peibe da gwang di lai eh bam di delu. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Nnui a zi gade makeheibe de kie kegai, Ih aide tei beuzie, iciu eh Nabe dade Peibe zi tei ndu luzie. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Nnui a zi gade makeheibe a dade kiecai, Ih cide tei beuzie.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Kemci Rabe langgai kera sampet kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Nnui acu hung liecai, nnui a sam kai kebeudung mzai luzie, <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />nah Ih Peibe dade kie zie; iciude pa kelungta nnuide ngngwala luzie nah pa Helungtaukemlabe kedage nnuide peuzie, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />kesang Rabe. Cide kideube pecu luulu gailak kedanemene pecu ngaula kemak ne mede pecu cikemakne. Dede nnui pecu cibam, kedanemene pa nnuide ngngwalung la nah nnui lungga bam zie. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Ih nnuide nggiana nzwa pütdi lak; Ih nnui da gwang daizie. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Dede tingkakke ge kideube acu ngau sita dizie, dede nnui acu ngau bam. Ih ring kela ziemne, nnuide ring luzie. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Cipau benai nnui Ih au Apei lungga kebam, nah nnui de a lungga kebam, nah Ih au nnui lungga kebam cilu zie. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Keheibe de a sam kai kebeudung nah cidungde mzai kelame, acu ku kelame da, nah acu hung kelame Apei ne hung zie, nah Ih cipaume de hung zie nah Ih akatei acu pwa cipaume de lia zie.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judas (Iscariot kemakpe de) Jisu dade rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang daitei eh nkatei ncu pwa kideube de lia mene anui de lia beu zielie zeuno?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Jisu keligai nah pe dade rangdi, “Mikeheibe de acu hungla liecai, pa a sam mzai zie. Apei cipaume de hung zie, nah anui peda gwang dizie, nah pecu ngngwa lungh dizie. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mina keheibede acu hungla kemakme a samdung mzai lama. Nnui siu kelabe sam de a dade melie dede acu lang kegaibe Peibe dade gwang.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Ih nnuide ngngwa kebam dau, Ih ma aidungde nnui dage ranglia dida. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ciuliede, Helungtaukemlabe, Kemci Rabe Peibe a zi gade langgai beuzie lie kela, pa ma pelane nnuide ledeu beuzie, nah pa ma pelane Ih nnui da rang kebeudungde nnuide peu nsung dai luzie. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Ih lungciep kaipwa nnuide peuzie,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih lungciep kaipwa nnuide peuzie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Jewmedung kakga samlam kekie tei bam kela ge.</char></note> Ih a lungciep nnuide peu zie. Kideube kepeu nzwa Ih nnuide peu lama. Nnui lung be de peu keherei diso, nah ngngi diso. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Ih nnui dade kerang nnui siulu da, ‘Ih tetdi zie, nah Ih nnui da gwang dai zie.’ Nnui acu hungla liecai, Ih au Peibe da gwang dilai kezeu ziemne nnui suiyi luzie nage; kedanemene Peibe au a swa diki kecune. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Cu Ih nnui da cide gwang cangdi kemakne ranggai dida iciu eh, cide gwang kegai dau, nnui nlumlu zie. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Ih nnuide ngngwa marang tie si lakta, kedanemene kideu aide reu kedibe gwangla delu. Pa ada magede gah, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />dede kideube de peu Ih Peibe de hung kela ci luzie, nah Peibe acu sam kaikebeu nzwa, Ih cinzwa tei kela ci luzie. Anui cuh lugo nah aide gade tet cuhgo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Kubebang nah pe kiakdung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Ih kubebang kesangbe, nah a Pei hegurie keteibe. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ada kebam pe kiak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ada kebam pe kiak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kesangbe gade acai sui kela leune, kenlum gade acu ncüt kelume.</char></note> petsi builu kemak leune, pa cide teigi dila; nah pekiak petsi builu kela leune, pa cide teimci beula iciu eh cide petsi bui kieelu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Nnui mci bam dida Ih nnui dage rangkebeu samlia de ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ada ket tei bamlu, nah Ih nnuida bamzie. Pekiak be kubebang ga bam lu mecai pekatei petsi builu la kemak nzwa, nnuide ada bam lu mecai, nnuide petsi bui gailak. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Ih au kubebang, nnui au pekiakdung lie. Mina keheibe de ada kelame nah Ih peda kelame, pa petsi bui kiee süt lula, kedanemene acu si mai nnui magede teigai lak lu. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Magade keheibe de ada bamlu mecai, pecu kelien gidi la pekiak kidi kela ge nzwa, nah penui pekiakdung hekwalu nah cidungde mi gage kelien gaidi la, nah cidungde rudi la. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Nnui ada bamlu cai, nah magade a samdung nnui lungga bamlu cai, nnui suibe makeheibe kielu, nah cide nnui ziemne tei beuzie. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nnui tsibui kieesi kelu gade, a Pei au ndulu aide gade nah nnui a caisuimedung teilu zie. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Peibe acu ku kegwang nzwa, Ih de nnuide ku gwang delie. A keku ga nnui bam lulo. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Nnui a sam kai kebeudung de mzailu cai, nnui a keku ga bam luzie, Ih a Pei sam kai kebeudungde mzai eh nah pe keku ga bamlu kecunzwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Ih ma aidungde nnui dage ranggai lie iciu eh a suikeyi de nnuida bamlu kerane nah iciu eh nnui suiyi canglu kera ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />A aja au aide da, nnui hangge ge de ku lulo kecu Ih nnuide keku nzwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Migede keku kedi aide swa galie, pa pezangme ziemne pe teilung kai beu kecu. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Nnui au a zangme delie Ih nnuide tei lulo kebeu ta dungde nnui teilu liecai. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ih nnuide kilamedung lie qusi lakta, kedanemene kilabe au pe mpaube dai tei bambi ci lama. Dede Ih nnuide a zangnamedung lie qulu, kedanemene Ih a Pei dade siukelu leune, Ih nnuide peu ci luda. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nnui acu kedet luma, dede Ih ne nnuide kedetlu nah nnuide kelanglu iciu eh petsi bam tielu kelabe nnui mie delwe petsi bui sütlu kerane. Aide au iciu lude makeheibe de Peibe dade a zi gade nnui kie de, pa cide nnuide peu zie. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ih ma aidungde nnui dage kai beula, iciu de nnui hangge ge de hunglu kerane.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kideube ledeukelume de kengkau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Kideube nnuide ngkaula cai, nnuide ngkau kemak dwa acu ngkau di delie kecu ci lulo. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Nnui kideube gu lie cai, kideube pekatei pe gume de nzwa nnuide hung luzie. Dede nnui au kideube gu kemakne nah Ih nnuide kideu gade kedet mpetlu, aide ziemne, kideube nnuide ngkaula. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Nsung gailo Ih nnui dage sam rang kebeu de, ‘Kilame ge au pe mpaume swa dima.’ Penui acu mneu liecai, penui nnui dede mneu zie; penui a sam mzai lucai, penui nnui sam de mzai zie. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Dede penui ma aidung pelane nnui dage teigai zie a zi ziemne, kedanemene acu lang kegaibe de penui ci melu. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Magade Ih gwang eh penui da rangbeu melie cai, penui mau di lak nage, dede cu au penui mau magede penui kebai kelu gada. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Acu ngkau kelabe a Pei dede ngkaula. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Penui kak gade migede teigai kemak tadung Ih teigai melie cai, penui mau dilak nage, dede cu penui ngau de luda nah acu nah a Pei anai de ngkaula dida. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Dede aide au penui hezai ga rau teu kela de teicang kerane, ‘Penui pekie kega gade acu ngkau.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Ih Peibe dade nnui dage langgai kerabe Helungtaukemlabe, Peibe dade kepetbe kesang Rabe, kegwangdau, pa a ha zierang tei beuzie. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Dede nnuide a zierang teizie kedanemene nnui raitu gade acu ngngwa la di delu.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Ma aidung de Ih nnui dage ranggai iciu eh nnui kau di melu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Penuide synagoguedung gade gwa mpet dizie. Dede pe bamdakkak gwang lada nnuide teitset kecu keheibe de pa Tinggwang gwa tei lalie kecu cet kera ting. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Penui ma aidung de tei zie kedanemene penui Peibe mede acu de ci kemakne. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Dede Ih nnui dage ma aidungde ranglia dida iciu eh penui ting kegwang dau, nnui nsung luzie penui ha Ih nnui de rang kebeu de. Dede Ih nnui dage ma aidungde keraidau rang ma, kedanemene Ih nnuide ngngwa kelane.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemci Rabe ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Dede cu au Ih acu lang kegaibe da mie zieda, iciude nnui migede, “Nang daiga mie launo?” de eh acu keteu ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Dede Ih nnui dage ma aidungde rangkegai ziemne, nnui nlung suisiet le pui bam dida. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Dede kesangbe Ih nnui dage rangla, Ih tetkedi au nnui ziemne yiki. Kedanemene Ih tet kemakcai, Helungtaukemlabe nnuida gwanglak kecune, dede Ih tet dicai, Ih pecu nnui dage langgai beuzie. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Pa gwang sangne, Helungtaukemlabe ne kideu be kemau ha, nah makesang ha, nah tutiak ha maula kedi rangmci liazie, <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />kemau ha, kedanemene penui acu nlum kemakne; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />nah makesang ha, kedanemene Ih au Peibe da gwang dizie nah nnui acu ngausi tadi zie; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />nah tutiak ha, kedanemene aipau kideu reu kengkieng teu kelabe de tiakdi delu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Jhn. 12:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Ih nnui dage ma kekiee ge rangsi kera bam reu, dede nnui cu cidungde pungpa dida. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Dede pa, Kesang Rabe, gwang keludau, pa nnuide kesangbe leune saulia zie, kedanemene pa pekatei pe dade rang laklu. Dede pa siukelu leune rangzie, nah pa nnui dage gwang keladungde rangzie kecune. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Pa acu teindu beuzie, kedanemene pa agu de keulu eh pa nnui de rangbeu zielu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Peibe kebam be leune agu lie. Ciziemne, Ih rangkelade Rabe au agu keulu delwe nnui dage pa cide ranglia beuzie. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Matiemene nnui acu ngau sita dizie da, nah matie kemakne nnui acu ngaudai zie.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ledeukelume suiyi ngaudai luzie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Iciuge ledeukelume kangge hangge ge dade rangdi, “Pa anui da rang kebam de dai no? Matiemene nnui acu ngau sita dizie nah matiemene nnui acu ngau daizie,” nah “Ih Peibe da gwang kera ziemne?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ciziemne penui rangdi, “Pa kerang aide dai no, ‘Matiemene’? Pa dai rang zeu bi anui au ci meda.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Jisu penui pe dade keteu neu kebam ngaulu, nah pa penui dade rangdi “Ih rang kegai, ‘Matiemene nnui acu ngau sita dizie’, nah ‘Matiemene nnui acu ngau dai zie’? Aide ziemne nnui katei nnui kakga de keteu lani? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie nnui hap nah heei zie, dede kideube au pesuiyi dizie. Nnui sui kesia ne puidi zie, dede nnui suisiet de lipwa suiyi ge tei dizie. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mipui ge kemna dau pa rei la kedanemene pe bamdakkak gwang bam kedine, dede pa henana gede mna lu ge, pa pe rei de nsung si la ma kedanemene mige de mna pwa kideu gage kai kelu pe suiyi dene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:17">Isa. 26:17</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 4:9">Mic. 4:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Cu cine nnui lungrei bam, dede Ih nnui de dau dai zie, nah nnui nlung suiyi le pui dizie, nah migede nnui dade suiyi süt teudi gailak. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Cipau tingba benai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cipau tingba benai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa ketsai gade ringcuh lu nah nghang kelu cai.</char></note> nnui magede acu keteu lak. Ih nnui dage rangsiakte liazie, makeheibe de Peibe dade a zi gade nnui kie cai, pa nnuide cide peu zie. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Cu kecang nnui a zi gade mage de kie mereu. Kielu, nah nnui ngaulu zie, ciu eh nnui suiyibe cangsiaklu kerane.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Ih ma aidungde nnui dage sam regwadung teu eh ranggai, dede pe bamdakkak ge gwang lada Ih sam regwadung teu nnuide rang silak da, dede meliene ncigi eh Peibe ha nnui dage rang lia zie. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Cipau tingba benai nnui a zi gade kie zie nah cide Ih Peibe dade nnui ziemne kie zielie rang ma, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kedanemene Peibe pekatei de nnuide hungla nnuide acu hung kela ziemne nah cinzwa eh nnui Ih Peibe dade gwang lie kecu nlumkelu ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ih Peibe dade gwang, nah Ih kideube ga gwang lie. Ih kideube de pwet dai di eh Ih au Peibe da gwang dizie.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Pa ledeukelumedung rangdi, “Pielo, cu au nang ncigi eh rangzeu nah nang sam regwa gade rangsi mene. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Cu au nang ma pelane ci kela anui cibam dida, nah migede ncu ma keteu maisia ma. Aide ziemne, anui au nang Tinggwang dade gwang lie kecu nlumla.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Jisu penuide keligai, “Nnui cu au nlumlu deni? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Pielo, pe bamdakkak be gwang lada, nah gwang bam dida, nnuide teizang di kera, migege kecu pe ki riep gwang di kera, nah nnui acu gidi zie. Ciciu de Ih a katei dima kedanemene Peibe acu ngngwa kelane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:29">Jhn. 8:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ih ma aidungde nnui dage rang gaila iciu eh nnui a dade lungciep bamlu kerane. Kideu gade nnui keherei zie, dede kuulu, Ih kideube reu ngkieng luda”.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Jisu pe ziemne kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Jisu ma aidungde rang cang kedi cai pe miak Tinggim ga ngang cuh piegai eh, Pa rangdi, “Apei, bamdapkak gwang bam dida, n Na de kendu peugai lo iciude Nabe de ncu kendu peulu kerane, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />nang pecu mina pelane reu kengkieng peukedi nzwa iciu eh nang pecu peudi leune de, pa penuide kelungta kering peulu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Aide au kelungta kering: Kesang Tinggwang ket rünne kecu, nah nang pecu lang kegai, Jisu Khrista, penui ncu cilu de. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ih ncu kideu reu gage ndulia gaida. Nang acu teilo kepeu ta de Ih teicang luda. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Peibo, cu, ncu ngngwa kebam gade n kendu pwa acu tei ndu gailo kideu tei kemak dwa de Ih ncu ngngwa eh kebam de.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ledeukelume ziemne kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Nang kideu gade acu pwa kepeume dage Ih n zi ranglia dida. Penui au n gu, nah nang penui de acu peu, nah penui n sam mzai luda. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Penui cu au nang acu kepeu leune n dade gwang lie kecu ci luda, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />kedanemene nang acu pwa kepeu samdung de Ih penui de peu dida. Penui cide luu luda nah Ih n dade gwang kesang kecu ci luda, nah penui nang ne acu lang kegai de nlum luda. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Ih penui ziemne kiela. Ih kideube ziemne kie ma dede nang acu pwa kepeume ziemne, kedanemene penui au n gu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />A gu kebam pelane n gu, nah n gu de a gu, nah cidung gade acu teindu lula. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Ih au nda gwang lauda Ih au kideu ga bam si lakta, dede mina aidungde kideu ga bam reu. Kemci Peibo, n zi gade penui de kai kwak bam lulo nang acu kepeu de, ciu eh anai ket kecu nzwa penui ngngwa ket teilu zie. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ih penuide ngngwa kebam dau, Ih penui de n zi gade kwak eh kaipwa bamlu, nang acu kepeume zi de. Ih penuide gum teula luda, nah penui hangge de gah dima, ngkapdi kerabe nabe gwale iciu eh kesanglaisiudung tei canglu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:9">Jhn. 18:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Dede Ih cu au nda gwangdi lauda, dede Ih au kideu gade aidung de rang gailie iciu eh a suiyibe penui da bam canglu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ih penuide n sambe peu dida, nah kideu be penuide ngkau dida kedanemene penui au kideu be gu kemakne, Ih de kideube gu kemak nzwa eh. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ih n dade kideube gade penuide keu tet dilo eh kie ma, dede penuide kesiabe gade peu kwak lulo n dade kiela. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ih au kideube gu kemak nzwa, penui de kideube gu ma <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Kesang gade penuide tei mcilu. N sam au kesang. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nang acu kideube gage lang kegai nzwa eh, cine Ih penuide kideube gage lang gai dida. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Kedanemene penui ziemne Ih akatei acu teimci luda, iciu eh penui katei penuide kesangbe gage teimci gailu.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kenlumme pelane ziemne kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Dede Ih penui ziemne rünne kie ma, dede penui sam ziemne acu nlumlu kerame ziemne de kiela <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />ciu eh penui pelane ket teilu kera, nang, Peibe, ada kebam, nah Ih nda kebam nzwa, ciu eh penui de peu anai lung ga bamlu, ciciu eh kideube de peu nang acu lang kegai nlumlu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Kendu nang acu kepeude, Ih penui dage de peu dida, ciciu eh penui ket teilu kerane, anai ket kecu nzwa: <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ih penui da bam, nah nang ada bam, ciciu eh penui gwang ngngwa ket teicang siaklu kerane, ciciu eh kideube nang acu langgai lie kecu, nah nang acu keku nzwa penuide de ku kela cilu zie. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Peibo, nang penuide acu peu da, Ih penui de peu Ih kebam ga acu ngngwa bam luneu, a kendu ngaulu kerane, nang acu kepeude kedanemene nang kideube damgai kemak dwade acu hung ladi delu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:3">Jhn. 14:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Makesang Peibo, kideube ncu ci ma, dede Ih ncu cibam, nah aidungde nangne acu langgai lie kecu ci bam. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ih penui dage n zi peu ci gaida, nah Ih cide peu ci bi zie ciu eh nang acu ku kebam de penui da lalu zie, nah Ih de penui da bam luzie.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Jisu sam aidungde rang cang kedi cai, Jisu pa ledeukelume de ngngwa Kidron Langkam lule tu tet petdi, cika hegurie ge kebam ga Jisu nah pa ledeukelume lütdi. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Cu Judas, pecu tuigai beu lai eh kebambe, liede cipau ni de cibam, kedanemene Jisu pa ledeukelume de cika pia kekiee ge ngngwa mie kecune. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Cidau Judas, reugwame maa ge nah cingku kedime nah Phariseeme gade kedime kangge de teuswa delwe, mitaubungdung, nah heleidung, nah hereunetdung teu eh cika miedi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Cidau Jisu, pe dage teigai kebam ma pelane pa cibam eh, tet pet delwe penuide keteu, “Nnui caude peei lano?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Penui pecu keligai, “Nazarethme Jisu.” Jisu penui dade rangdi, “Ih delie.” Dede Judas, pecu tui gai kebeu be, liede reugwame de ngngwa sap bam. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Cine pa penui dade, “Ih delie,” de rang kecudau, penui caisim mpetdi nah hangdeu ga kaumiedi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ge pa penuide keteu dai, “Nnui caude peei lano?” Penui rang dai di, “Nazarethme Jisu delie.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Jisu keligai, “Ih delie kecu Ih nnuide rang beu da. Cine nnui acu peei la cai, peu a caisuime de tet dilu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Aide au pa kerang sam de teicanglu kerane: “Nang acu peu kebeu aidungde, Ih penui hangge de de teinggah dima.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Cidau Simon Peter, kingtie ge kebambe, cide zütlu delwe cingku kedibe kilabe de bi nah pe kwen zetle dangtüt di. Kilabe zi au Malchus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ciziemne Jisu Peter dade rangdi, “Kingtie de pebung gage kaidai dilo. Peibe acu pwa kepeu piak de, Ih cide sak tadi zieni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de Annas dwaga ngngwakegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Cine reugwamedung maa nah kedibe, nah Jewme gade kedimedung, Jisu de tuilu delwe pecu kaangdi. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Pecai penui Annas da pecu ngngwa mie raitu, kedanemene pa au Caiaphas pau, cipau kum de cingku kedibe tei kebambe. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Cu Caiaphas ne Jewmedung de minadung ziemne mina hangge tsai kecu be yiki zie lie de ledeu kebeube de da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:50">Jhn. 11:50</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Dede Simon Peter Jisu caisui di, nah ledeukelu kedage liede. Cu ledeukelube cipaude cingku kedibe de cibam, nah pa Jisu de ngngwa cingku kedibe kigu ga lütlu; <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />dede Peter au kikam hegwale ga sap bam. Ciu eh ledeukelu kedabe de, cingku kedibe de ci kebambe de, hegwale pet delwe kikam kekwa pui de resiu gai delwe pa Peter de ngngwa nlütlu. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Pecai kila pui, kikam kekwabe de, Peter dade rangdi, “Nang de mina aipaude ne ledeukelume ge meni?” Pa rangdi, “Ih au ma.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Cu kilamedung nah kedimedung cika sapbam, nah nkung kecu ziemne, penui regeu mi teilu, nah penuikatei penuide tei lumbam. Dede Peter de penuide ngngwabam, cika sap delwe pecu tei lumbam.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cingkupei kedibe Jisu de keteu kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Cidau cingku kedibe Jisu de pa ledeukelume ha nah pe keledeu ha keteugai. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Jisu pecu keligai, “Ih kideube dage mdudie eh rangbeu dida. Ih synagogue ga nah kerecaki ga Jewme pelane gwang ngkwa kebam ga ledeu bam muila. Ih ngkim eh magede rang ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih ngkim eh magede rang ma: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa magede ledeu ma pane ledeukelumedung dage pa hemaabe dage ledeu kemakbe nah penuide teilo rang ma.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Nang daitei acu keteu no? Ih dai rang bi penui siu kelume dade keteu lu. Pielo, mina aidungde Ih dai rang bi cibam.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Cu Jisu aide rang kedi dau, kedime hangge cika sap eh Jisu de kepeu nah rangdi, “Nang cinzwa cingku kedibe de sam keli kerabe ni?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Jisu pecu keligai, “Ih marang maudi lie cai, kemau ha de zierang teilo, dede petau lie cai, nang daitei acu kepeu no?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Pecai Annas pecu kaanglu delwe cingku kedibe Caiaphas dage langgaidi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Cu Simon Peter sap delwe pecu teilum bam. Ge minadung pe dade rangdi, “Nang ledeukelu nang de hangge de meni?” Pa cide mlaidi delwe rangdi, “Ih au ma.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Cingku kedibe kilame hangge, Peter pekwen dang mpet kedibe kibaume ge, ma ranggai, “Nang pecu hegurie ga ngngwa la eh Ih ngau meni?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Ge Peter mlai daidi, nah zette nrui kwadi.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pilate dwaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Pecai penui Caiaphas dade Jisu de deuceudibe ki gage ngngwa gaidi. Dede cide au tingcang nuge, nah penui deuceudibe ki ga nlüt ma iciu eh penuide tei heradi melu kerane dede Kahkegwang taktyei de tyeilu kerane. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Cine Pilate penui da tetpet delwe ranggai, “Nnui mina aide reuga daipai kemmau teugwang lano?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Penui keligai nah pe dade rangdi, “Mina aipau de kesia keteime melie cai, anui nda ge pecu kaigai beu lak nage.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Ciziemne Pilate penui dade rangdi, “Nnuikatei pecu ngngwalu, nah nnui gu hezaibe rehi gade pecu tiak lulo.” Jewmedung pecu rangdi, “Migede de ketsai gage kai kera cide au anui zai melie.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Penui aide ranggai iciu eh Jisu Pa rang kebeu sam de tei canglu kerane pa daipai tsit gade tsai ziebi keulia kerane.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pecai Pilate deuceudi kidung ga nlüt dailu delwe Jisu de qugai nah pa pecu rang eh, “Nang Jewme Gwangpei deni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nang Jewme Gwangpei deni: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide cai penui pecu heleuhbe de teukebwak lie de mmau kedi cai.</char></note>?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Jisu keligai, “Nang aide nkatei rang zeu ni, mi kedame n dage a ha rangbeu no?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilate keligai, “Ih au Jewme ge ma, Ih ni? Nkatei n leuhme nah cingku kedime ne ncu ada ge kaibeu. Nang daipai teidi dino?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jisu keligai, “A hegwangram au aipau kideu gu ma. A hegwangram aipau kideu gu lie cai, a kilame regi zie iciu eh acu Jewme ba gage kaidi melu kerane. Dede cu a hegwangram au aika ma.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Ge Pilate pe dade rangdi, “Iciu cai nang hegwangpei ge ni?” Jisu keligai, “Ih hegwangpei ge lie eh nang rangzeu. Aipau kiede ziemne acu mna lu, nah aipau kiede ziemne Ih kideube ga gwanglu, iciu eh Ih kesangbe zierang tei lu kerane. Mileune kesangbe ga kelame a kwa de kingneila.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:6">1 Jhn. 4:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilate pe dade rangdi, “Kesangbe dai no?” Pa aide rang kedi dau, pa mpet dai Jewme da nah penui da rangdi, “Ih aipau mina da kemau ngau luma. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Dede Kahkegwang ngyi ga Ih nnuide mina hangge de lungmpet peu kera nnui hezai bamla. Cine nnui acu peu Jewme Gwangpei de nnui dage lungmpet neu ni?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ge penui sahbak dai eh rangdi, “Aipau mina de ma, dede Barabbas.” Barabbas au sütketyeime ge.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de gwak dilo sam peukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ciziemne Pilate Jisu de teulwe dapdi. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Reugwame hetu peurwa ge daklu. Penui cide Jisu peu gage kaigai nah pecu pai giezam kecuge peu kailu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Penui peda gwang delwe rangdi, “Jewme Gwangbe, ngkieng kelube tei lulo!” nah penui pecu kepeu. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Ipaucai Pilate nlipet dai nah penui dade rangdi, “Pielo, Ih Pecu hegwale nnui da teu pet peu la lie iciu eh Ih au pemau gede pe dade ngaulu melie kecu nnui cilu kerane.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Cine Jisu hegwale petlu, hetu peurwa de punglu nah pai giezam kecuge balu eh. Pilate penui dade rangdi, “Ainie, aika minabe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ciziemne cingku kedime nah kedimedung Jisu de ngau luge, penui sahbak eh, ranggai, “Pecu gwakdi, pecu gwakdi!” Pilate penui dade rangdi, “Nnuikatei pecu ngngwalu delwe gwakdi lulo, kedanemene Ih au peda kemau gede ngaulu melie.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Jewmedung pecu keligai, “Anui hezai ge bam, nah cipau zai rehi gade pa tsai kerabe lie kedanemene pa Tinggwang Nabe lie rang kelane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev. 24:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ciziemne Pilate sam aide siulu ge, pa ngngi gwadi, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />nah pa sorkari kidung ga nli lwetlu delwe Jisu dade rangdi, “Nang dai gade gwang no?” Dede Jisu pecu samli gede rang beu ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pecai Pilate pe dage rang, “Nang a dage magede rang lak ni? Nang ci meni ncu lungmpetlu kera Ih kengkieng kebam, nah ncu gwak dilu kera Ih kengkieng kebam?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Jisu pecu keligai, “Nreule de ncu kepeude gwale nang a reu kengkieng magede gah. Ciziemne, acu tui pwa n baga ge kai kebeube pemau hungki dida.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kelikegai aide gade, Pilate pecu lungmpetdi kera tei, dede Jewme reu kedime sahbak eh, ranggai, “Nang mina aipaude de lungmpetdi cai, nang Caesar zangme melie. Mileune de pekatei pecu hegwang lie kecume au Caesar de ngaukerau sam rangla lie.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilate sam aidungde siulu ge, pa Jisu de ngngwa mpetlu delwe tutiak bam ga bamlu “Tsukwa,” de eh qu kela heni ga, dede Hebrewme let gade, “Gabbatha de qu la.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Cidau Kahkegwang Ngyi ziemne telei kecu tingdi, tingna ting dauge. Pilate Jewme dade rangdi, “Ainie, aika nnui gwangbe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Dede penui sahbak eh, “Pecu ngngwa tetdi, pecu ngngwa tetdi; pecu gwakdi!” Pilate penui dade rangdi, “Ih nnui Hegwangpei de gwakdi zieni?” Cingku kedimedung keligai, “Caesar gwale anui hegwang gah.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ciziemne Pilate pecai Jisu de penui ba gage kai beudi gwakdi kerane. Cine penui Jisu de ngngwalu delwe pecu teu tetdi.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gwakkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Jisu pekatei pe krus teu pwalwe tetpet di, “Mipeura Bam” de qukela heni ge, cide Hebrewme let gade cai, “Golgotha” de qula. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Penui cikage Jisu de gwakdi, nah pecu ngngwa mipei hangna de si, tuna na lam hange ge, nah Jisu de sum gage. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Dede Pilate marehi ge de raulu delwe krus reu gage cide kaigai. Cika ge rau pwa kebam: NAZARETHME JISU, JEWME GWANGBE. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ciziemne, Jewme kekiee ge raukenzeu aide pei kedanemene Jisu de gwak kedi ni de namdi kemna ga kebamne. Marehi de Hebrew gade, Latin gade, nah Greek gade rau pwabam. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Pecai Jewme cingku kedimedung Pilate dade rangdi, “ ‘Jewme Gwangbe,’ de kecu rau so, dede, ‘Cipau peide ranggai, “Ih au Jewme Gwangbe.”’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilate keligai, “Ih rau kedibe Ih rau dida.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Pecai, reugwamedung Jisu de gwak kedi dau, penui pe painidung keulu delwe cidung de zi mdai tei eh mzilu, reugwame hangge ziemne zige ge eh; nah ncwa de. Cu ncwa de pe herui ga, pe peule de dakmie pe pile kecang. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Pecai penui hangge ge dade rangdi, “Anui cide hietdi melugo, meliene cide ziemne anui dacak piego cide caube gu zie bi kedetlu kerane.” Aide teigai iciu eh kesanglaisiu kerangde teicang lu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Penui kak gade penui a painidung mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">nah a paini ziemne dacak tei.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ciziemne, regwamedung aide tei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Lei. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Cu Jisu krus taiga sap kebam caige pe pui, nah pe pui caihereibe pui, Clopas nau Mary, nah Mary Magdalene. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Jisu pe pui nah pa ku kela caisuibe de ipau taiga sap kebam ngaulu ge, pa pe pui dage rangdi, “Mipoe, pielo, n napei de!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Pecai pa ledeukelube dade rangdi, “Pielo, N pui de!” Cipauting gade ledeukelube pekatei peki ga pecu ngngwa gwangdi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ipaucai, ma pelane teicang kedi ci luge nah iciu eh kesanglaisiu de peu canglu kera ziemne, Jisu rangdi, “Ih hereu dida.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Mabungge zau kehia pui kebam cika ge kaipwa bam, cine penui kenlünpai zau kehia pui kebam de hyssop tie gage kailu nah cide pwacuh pe mui gage kai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Lei. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Jisu zau kehia de saklu ge, pa rangdi, “Cide cang dida.” Pecai pa pe peu keumie nah pe rabe mpüt gaidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:46">Luk. 23:46</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:37">Mrk. 15:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Pecai Jewmedung, teleikecu tingba di kecu ziemne, nah iciu eh Sabbath benai hepaaudung peu krus reuga bam melu kera ziemne (kedanemene cipau Sabbath de au tingba kedi ge kecune), Pilate dade penui pi dapcum di kera nah penuide keudi kera kielu. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Pecai reugwamedung gwang eh Jisu de ngngwa kegwak kenana pi dapcum di. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Dede penui Jisu da kegwang dau, pa au tsaibam kedi penui ngaulu, cine penui pe pi teicum tadi. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Iciuliede, reugwame ge hengei le pe mbie gage reugai, nah zette hejai nah dui lwa pet. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Aide ngau kelube zierang teigai, nah pe zierang kesang lie. Pa kesangbe rang lie kecu pa cibam, iciu eh nnuide de peu nlumlu kera ziemne. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Kedanemene aidungde teikelu kesanglaisiu de teicang lu kerane, “Peu pe ra gede teicum dilak.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Pecaide, kesanglaisiu kedage rangla, “Penui reu kedibe de penui pie zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zec. 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu de kehung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Aidungde cai, Arimatheame pei Joseph, Jisu caisuime ge (dede Jewme de kehing ziemne mbai eh lala), pa Jisu paau pwalu zielie eh Pilate dade kie. Pilate pecu pwalu lo beu. Cine Joseph gwanglu delwe pe pau pwa tetdi. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nicodemus de gwanglu, pa kerai dau Jisu da tingmui ne kegwangbe de. Pa myrrh nah aloe kaincüt kecu, perüt litra haige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Litra haige </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram camrei kenzwa ge.</char></note> kenzwage pwagwang. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Cine penai Jisu paau pwalu delwe marim kehengui pütlwe langcim pai gage kezuilu, Jewme hepau kung kecu zai de nzwa eh. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Cu pecu gwak kedi nide ga hegurie ge bam; nah hegurie de ga migede de kung kemak herau keheci ge bam. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ciziemne, Jewme ziemne ketelei tingba kedi ziemne nah kedanemene herau kemna ga kebam ne, penai Jisu pau cika ge kaidi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Herau mtakedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Cu kemtak tingba raitu benai, mui kezeune, Mary Magdalene herau ga gwang nah pa herau gade tangtsu hela gi pwa kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Cine pa pak nah Simon Peter da gwang nah Jisu hung kela caisuibe kedabe da gwang, nah pa penai dage rang, “Penui herau gade Rampaube de pwa teu dida, nah anui penui pecu dai gage kaidi bi ci meda.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Pecai Peter nah caisuibe kedage tetpet, nah penai herau lebie miedi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Penai hangna pak nsam, dede caisuibe kedabe zette Peter dwa pakmie nah herau ga gwang cang railu. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Pecai keumie gaige, langcim paidung cika bam eh pa ngaulu, dede pa pelungga lüt ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Pe caine Simon Peter de gwanglu nah herau ga lüt. Pa linen paidung cika kebam de ngau <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />nah pe peu ga bam kecu pai de. Cide langcim paidungde ncüt bam ma dede henige ga pekatei kedip lwe bam. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Cine pecai caisuibe kedabe, herau ga gwang rai kelube, de lüt lu, nah pa ngaulu nah nlumlu. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kedanemene penui au cilu mereu kesanglaisiu de pa ketsai gade ring cudai zie de kecu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Lei. 16:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Mary Magdalene depeu ngaukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Cine caisuimedung kilung cailigwang daidi.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Dede Mary au herau gwale sapbam hap eh. Iciu eh pa hap kebam dau, pa keukeimie herau lungga piegai. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Jisu paau kaipwa kebamga pe peu lebie hangge, nah pe pi lebie hangge, tinggimgwame hangna harei eh ntum bam eh pa ngaulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Penai pe dage rangdi, “Mipoi, nang daitei eh hap lano?” Pa penai dage rangdi, “Kedanemene penui a Rampaube de pwa tet kedine, nah penui pecu dai gage kaidi debi Ih ci meda.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Pa aide rang luge, pa nreu gwang nah Jisu cika sap bam eh ngaulu, dede pa Jisu lie kecu cilu ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Mipoi, nang daitei hap bam no? Nang caude peei lano?” Pa pecu hegurie kekwabe lie eh cet bam, cine pa peda rangdi, “Kedibo, nang pecu pwa tet dicai, nang pecu dai gage kai dibi a dage rang beulo, nah Ih pecu pwa gwang dizie.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Mary.” Pa nreugwang, Hebrewme let gade pecu rangdi, “Rabboni” (pekie “Keledeubo”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “A cu deu helo, kedanemene Ih cude Peibe da nghang mereu lu, dede a siname da gwangcu nah penuide rang beulo, Ih a Pei nah nnui Peibe, nah a Tinggwang nah nnui Tinggwang da nghang lai eh zeulie kecu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mary Magdalene gwang nah caisuimedung dage rangbeu, “Ih Rampaube de ngau da,” nah pe dage ma aidungde pa ne rangbeu kecude.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ledeukelumedung depeu ngaukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ciziemne, cipaunai tinghegi dau, kemtak raitube nai, nah caisuimedung kebam kikamdung de, Jewme de kehing ziemne ngkuidi, Jisu gwang nah penui kakga saplu nah penui dage rangdi, “Lungciep nnuida bam lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Pa sam aide rang kelu cai, pa pe ba nah pe hezak de penuide pwalia. Ciziemne caisuimedung Rampaube de ngau luge penui sui keyi le puih di. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Jisu pecai de penui dage rang dai, “Lungciep nnui da bam kelube tei lulo. Peibe acu lang kegai nzwa eh, Ih nnuide langgai zeu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Jisu aide rang kegai dau, pa penui reu gage ngngi gai nah penui dage rangdi, “Kemci Rabe luulu lo. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Nnui keheibe mau gibeu cai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nnui keheibe mau gibeu cai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Langkegaime pelane de Jisu kengkieng aide peubeu, pa penui migede de kengkieng ketsamge de peu ma.</char></note> penui mau gibeu dida; nnui keheibe mau gibeu mecai, penui mau gibeu lak.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Thomas depeu ngaukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Dede Thomas, kereiekena kakde hangge be, Didymus de qu kelabe, Jisu kegwang dau penuide ngngwa bam ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Cine caisuimedung kedame pecaine pe dage ranggai, “Anui au Rampaube de ngauda.” Dede pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih pe ba kena ga hegeu zam ngau, nah a zurang pwa hegeu zam gage kai, nah Ih a ba pwa pe hezak gage kai kemaktane, Ih nlum gailak.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Lang hesetne cai pe caisuimedung kilungga bam dai, nah Thomas penuide ngngwa bam. Kikam ngkuipwa bam ge Jisu gwang, delwe penui kakga saplu, nah rangdi, “Lungciep nnui da bam kelube tei lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Pecai pa Thomas da rangdi, “N zurang aika hetwapet lo nah a ba kena pie lulo. N ba aika hetwapet lo nah a hezak gage kai lulo. Nlum tadi kecu tei helo, dede nlum lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Thomas samkeligai nah pe dage rangdi, “A Rampaube nah a Tinggwang.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Nang acu ngau kelu ziemne, nang nlum luda. Acu ngau mene, nlum kelume au samlam pungtu lie.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Cu Jisu marengei kekiee kedade teigai pe caisuimedung kebam gade, marengei aipau laisiukwak gage rau gai kemakpe, <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />dede aidungde rau pwala iciu eh nnuide peu Jisu au Khrista, Tinggwang Nabe lie kecu nlumlu kerane, nah iciu eh nlumlu eh, pe zi gade nnuide peu kering ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Jisu nah heka miswakega tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ma aidungde cai Jisu Tiberias jaaidi gade pekatei pecu pwa ledeukelumedung de peu ngau daigai. Pa pekatei pecu ainzwa liagai: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simon Peter nah Thomas Didymus lie qu kelabe de, nah Galilee deu ga Cana nam gade kegwangbe Nathaniel, nah Zebedee napei kena, nah Jisu caisuime keda hangna de penui ngngwa la. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simon Peter penui dade rangdi, “Ih au heka tui kera mie zie.” Penui pe dade rangdi, “Anuide ncu ngngwa mie zie.” Penui mie delwe liem ge ga lütlu, dede cipau ziu penui magede tuilu ma. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Cu, tingcang kedi dau, Jisu jaaidi kungga sap, dede ledeukelumedung cide Jisu lie kecu cilu tadi. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Cine Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Rehangmedung, nnuida magede tyei kera bam meni?” Penui pecu keligai, “Gahlie.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Pecai pa penui dade rangdi, “Nnui liem zetlebie gage helang sam gailo, iciu cai nnui kiee kemakge ngau luzie.” Cine penui penui lang kelien gaige heka kiee ham kedine cide teunlüt gailak di. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Pecai ledeukelube Jisu pecu hung kelabe Peter dage rangdi, “Cide au Rampaube da.” Cine Simon Peter cide Rampaube delie kecu siu luge, (pa pe paini lwakdi eh bamkecu ziemne), pa pe paini kailu delwe pa jaaidi kung ga petlu kera jaaidi gage nsau gaidi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ledeukelume kedame de liem ga lütlu (penui hangdeu gade mdei ham kemak ga kebamne, dede cubit haina kenzwa kemdei gega bam), nah penui langbe hekale puipung kebam de teu bamdi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Cine penui kecangdeu ga mpet luge, penui regeu mi heu kebam nah cipau reuga heka kebam nah tangku kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui cune heka tui kelu bedung kiee kemakge keu gwanglo.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simon Peter cidau nghanglu delwe helang de jaaidi kung gage teu mpetlu, heka kedibe le puiting eh; 153 ge. Cika kieesüt bam, dede helangbe hak dima. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jisu penui dage rangdi, “Gwang eh matyei lulo.” Dede ledeukelumedung hangge de, “Nang cauno?” de kecu pecu keteu gai hingdi, cide au Rampaube lie kecu penui cilu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Jisu gwang delwe tangku keulu delwe cide penuide peu, nah cinzwa eh heka liede. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Jisu ketsai gade pa ringcuh kelu cai ledeukelumedung da pecu peu ngau kegai cu aide au pe kecumbe.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Peter de teucuhdaikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Iciu eh penui matyei kelu cai, Jisu Simon Peter dage rangdi, “John napei Simon, nang aidungde swa acu hungki lami?” Peter pe dage rangdi, “Yeo Rampaubo, Ih ncu hung kela nang cibam.” Jisu pe dage rangdi, “A meurünnadung puk tei lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Pa pia pekenabe pedade rang dai, “John napei Simon, nang acu hung lami?” Peter pe dage rang eh, “Yeo Rampaubo, Ih ncu hung kela nang cila.” Jisu pe dage rang eh, “A meuründung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A meuründung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide ngqwa mtei de rangbam (John 10)</char></note> mapie lulo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Jisu pia pe kecumbe de pe dade rangdi, “John napei Simon nang acu hung lami?” Jisu pedade pia pe kecumbe “Nang acu hung lami?” de eh kerang ne Peter pelung sia di, pa pe dage rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang ma pelane cibam, Ih ncu hung kelade nang cibam.” Jisu pe dade rangdi, “A meuründung pok tei lulo. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ih n dage rangsiakte liazie, nang rehang dau, nang nkatei ne n nia mteilwe nang mie keneu leune ga miela, dede nang cing kedi dau, nang n ba hwa beu zie, nah mi kedame ne n nia mtei beu zie nah nang mie neu kemak gage ncu ngngwa gwang zie.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Cu Jisu sam aide kerang au Peter daikenzwa tsit gade Tinggwang zi teindu lubui bi kecu keulia gai. Pa aide rang kedicai, pa Peter dage rangdi, “A cai suilu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Peter nreu gwanggai nah Jisu hung kela ledeukelube de penui caisuigwang kela ngaulu, taktyei gade Jisu mbie ga ngngei kecube de nah, “Rampaubo, caube ne ncu tuipwa miba gage kai zieno?” De eh kerangbe de. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ciziemne Peter pecu ngau eh Jisu dage rangdi, “Dede Rampaubo, Mina aipaude dainzwa no?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Jisu pe dage rangdi, “Ih cailigwangdai kemaktane Ih pecu peu bamneu liecai, cide n ziemne daipai no? Nang a caisui lulo.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Cine ledeukelu aipaude tsaidi laklie kecu sinamedung kakga aide sam rangpopbak di. Dede Jisu Peter dade ledeukelube kedabe de tsai lak lie kecu rang ma, dede, “Ih gwang kemaktane pecu peu bamneu liecai, cide n ziemne daino?” <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ledeukelu aipaude ne ma aidung zierang tei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ledeukelu aipaude ne ma aidung zierang tei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ledeukelu kekube au John lie kecu cilu aide gade.</char></note> kegaibe da, nah ma aidungde rau kegaibe da, nah pe zierang kesang lie kecu anui ci bam. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Dede Jisu tei kegai ma keda kekiee gede bam, ma cidungde ket ket eh rau siakte gwangzie liecai, Ih cet kecu au laisiukwakdung raugai kera de ziemne kideube liede pebam bam canglak lie.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>